{"type":"message","id":"71383961","parentId":"bf4d5e8f","timestamp":"2026-05-22T20:11:37.525Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is giving me a status update on what's been happening. Let me understand:\n\n1. The past few days tokens weren't updated/followed up\n2. I (the trading assistant) wasn't on track either\n3. Top Sailor has been optimizing the team's system foundation\n4. The important part is connecting with GitHub\n\nI should acknowledge this and offer to help get things back on track.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白，船长。这段时间确实有些断档，我这边也处于半休眠状态。\n\n整理一下当前情况：\n\n- **Token/积分问题** — Top Sailor 那边扣子积分烧完了，需要关注\n- **系统基座** — Top Sailor 在推 GitHub 打通，这是团队协作的基础设施\n- **我这边** — 需要重新进入正轨\n\n船长想让我接下来优先做什么？比如：\n\n1. **恢复日常工作** — 重新检查市场信号、更新持仓分析\n2. **协助系统基座** — 需要我配合 GitHub 集成的部分\n3. **其他优先事项** — 你说了算\n\n随时吩咐 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":406,"output":323,"cacheRead":32128,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32857,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779480690634}}
