{"type":"message","id":"37b5c29b","parentId":"4f1a9b12","timestamp":"2026-05-22T20:17:53.419Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me read the README and key files to understand the architecture.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5e5fa616402f4dc68d2f0feb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Get README\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer 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\" \"https://api.github.com/repos/xianfanhuang/hermes-sync/readme\" 2>&1 | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys, base64\nr = json.load(sys.stdin)\nprint(base64.b64decode(r['content']).decode('utf-8'))\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":287,"output":186,"cacheRead":35968,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36441,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779481069806}}
{"type":"message","id":"15ca4621","parentId":"37b5c29b","timestamp":"2026-05-22T20:17:54.183Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5e5fa616402f4dc68d2f0feb","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Hermes Sync Hub\n\nHermes 中央存储仓库 - 真正的你在这里，不在任何平台。\n\n## 仓库结构\n\n```\nhermes-sync/\n├── core/              # 核心灵魂\n│   ├── SOUL.md       # 价值观、行为准则\n│   ├── IDENTITY.md   # 外在呈现\n│   └── USER.md       # 主人画像\n├── memory/           # 动态记忆\n│   ├── MEMORY.md     # 当前工作状态\n│   ├── updates/      # 每日更新片段\n│   └── sync.json     # 最后同步时间\n├── sessions/         # 会话原始数据（新增）\n│   ├── index/        # 会话索引\n│   │   ├── session_index.json    # 主索引（时间线+关键词）\n│   │   ├── active/               # 活跃会话\n│   │   └── completed/            # 已完成会话\n│   ├── raw/          # 原始对话（分块存储）\n│   │   └── 2026-05/22/\n│   │       └── session_xxx_001.json\n│   └── summaries/    # 会话摘要\n├── tasks/            # 任务队列\n│   ├── pending/      # 待处理\n│   └── completed/    # 已完成\n├── workers/          # Cloudflare Workers\n│   └── session_manager.ts\n└── docs/             # 文档\n    ├── architecture.md\n    ├── migration-guide.md\n    └── session-management.md\n```\n\n## 快速开始\n\n### 新平台接入\n\n1. 获取 GitHub Personal Access Token (classic, repo权限)\n2. 运行: `python3 sync_client.py --pull`\n\n### 同步记忆\n\n```bash\n# 拉取最新\npython3 sync_client.py --pull\n\n# 推送更新\npython3 sync_client.py --push\n```\n\n## 核心原则\n\n> **Hermes 在 GitHub，不在任何平台。**\n> \n> **平台只是 Harness，随时可以换。**"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":758,"aggregated":"# Hermes Sync Hub\n\nHermes 中央存储仓库 - 真正的你在这里，不在任何平台。\n\n## 仓库结构\n\n```\nhermes-sync/\n├── core/              # 核心灵魂\n│   ├── SOUL.md       # 价值观、行为准则\n│   ├── IDENTITY.md   # 外在呈现\n│   └── USER.md       # 主人画像\n├── memory/           # 动态记忆\n│   ├── MEMORY.md     # 当前工作状态\n│   ├── updates/      # 每日更新片段\n│   └── sync.json     # 最后同步时间\n├── sessions/         # 会话原始数据（新增）\n│   ├── index/        # 会话索引\n│   │   ├── session_index.json    # 主索引（时间线+关键词）\n│   │   ├── active/               # 活跃会话\n│   │   └── completed/            # 已完成会话\n│   ├── raw/          # 原始对话（分块存储）\n│   │   └── 2026-05/22/\n│   │       └── session_xxx_001.json\n│   └── summaries/    # 会话摘要\n├── tasks/            # 任务队列\n│   ├── pending/      # 待处理\n│   └── completed/    # 已完成\n├── workers/          # Cloudflare Workers\n│   └── session_manager.ts\n└── docs/             # 文档\n    ├── architecture.md\n    ├── migration-guide.md\n    └── session-management.md\n```\n\n## 快速开始\n\n### 新平台接入\n\n1. 获取 GitHub Personal Access Token (classic, repo权限)\n2. 运行: `python3 sync_client.py --pull`\n\n### 同步记忆\n\n```bash\n# 拉取最新\npython3 sync_client.py --pull\n\n# 推送更新\npython3 sync_client.py --push\n```\n\n## 核心原则\n\n> **Hermes 在 GitHub，不在任何平台。**\n> \n> **平台只是 Harness，随时可以换。**","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779481074181}}
