{"type":"message","id":"bbd2d282","parentId":"4da8fecf","timestamp":"2026-05-22T20:18:02.618Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me continue reading more files to understand the full picture.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3411f52eed114f4e9ebf0b63","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Get hermes-skills README\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer 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\" \"https://api.github.com/repos/xianfanhuang/hermes-skills/readme\" 2>&1 | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys, base64\nr = json.load(sys.stdin)\nprint(base64.b64decode(r['content']).decode('utf-8'))\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":291,"output":189,"cacheRead":36864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37344,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779481078881}}
{"type":"message","id":"c242ca06","parentId":"bbd2d282","timestamp":"2026-05-22T20:18:03.347Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3411f52eed114f4e9ebf0b63","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Hermes Skills\n\nHermes 双轨制技能仓库 —— 与核心层分离，按需加载。\n\n## 架构\n\n```\nHermes-Core (轻量迁移包)\n    ↓ 加载\nskill-manifest.json\n    ↓ 按需clone\nHermes-Skills (本仓库)\n```\n\n## 使用\n\n### 新环境初始化\n\n```bash\n# 1. 加载必需技能\npython3 hermes-cli.py --load-required\n\n# 2. 加载所有技能\npython3 hermes-cli.py --load-all\n\n# 3. 加载指定技能\npython3 hermes-cli.py --skill token-budget-manager\n```\n\n### 列出可用技能\n\n```bash\npython3 hermes-cli.py --list\n```\n\n## 技能清单\n\n| 技能 | 版本 | 优先级 | 说明 |\n|-----|------|--------|------|\n| hermes-migration | 2.0 | 100 | 迁移系统 |\n| token-budget-manager | 2.1 | 90 | 轻量预算管理 |\n\n## 版本管理\n\n- 每个skill独立版本\n- Git tag格式: `skill-name-vx.x.x`\n- manifest自动追踪版本\n\n## 开发规范\n\n1. 每个skill必须有SKILL.md，包含version字段\n2. 敏感信息不进仓库（API key等）\n3. 更新后及时打tag"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":719,"aggregated":"# Hermes Skills\n\nHermes 双轨制技能仓库 —— 与核心层分离，按需加载。\n\n## 架构\n\n```\nHermes-Core (轻量迁移包)\n    ↓ 加载\nskill-manifest.json\n    ↓ 按需clone\nHermes-Skills (本仓库)\n```\n\n## 使用\n\n### 新环境初始化\n\n```bash\n# 1. 加载必需技能\npython3 hermes-cli.py --load-required\n\n# 2. 加载所有技能\npython3 hermes-cli.py --load-all\n\n# 3. 加载指定技能\npython3 hermes-cli.py --skill token-budget-manager\n```\n\n### 列出可用技能\n\n```bash\npython3 hermes-cli.py --list\n```\n\n## 技能清单\n\n| 技能 | 版本 | 优先级 | 说明 |\n|-----|------|--------|------|\n| hermes-migration | 2.0 | 100 | 迁移系统 |\n| token-budget-manager | 2.1 | 90 | 轻量预算管理 |\n\n## 版本管理\n\n- 每个skill独立版本\n- Git tag格式: `skill-name-vx.x.x`\n- manifest自动追踪版本\n\n## 开发规范\n\n1. 每个skill必须有SKILL.md，包含version字段\n2. 敏感信息不进仓库（API key等）\n3. 更新后及时打tag","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779481083343}}
