{"type":"message","id":"1474546b","parentId":"00620aaa","timestamp":"2026-05-22T20:52:50.897Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants me to integrate my key findings into the Hermes ecosystem and test it. Let me think about what this means:\n\n1. I should integrate my trading assistant capabilities into the Hermes sync/skills system\n2. I need to do this without breaking anything\n3. Then test the integration\n\nLet me think about what \"无缝整合\" means here:\n- My trading skills and memory should be accessible through the Hermes system\n- I should follow the existing patterns (SOUL.md, IDENTITY.md, USER.md, MEMORY.md)\n- My knowledge should become a Hermes Skill\n\nLet me start by understanding what needs to be done:\n\n1. Create a trading-assistant skill in hermes-skills\n\n\n2. Sync my key memory files with hermes-sync\n3. Test the integration\n\nBut wait—VAN said not to touch code directly. He wants me to first understand the team situation on GitHub. Now he's asking me to integrate my key findings and test them, but I'm in a sandbox without network access to actually push to GitHub. I think the right approach is to prepare the content and structure locally, then present what I've found and what needs to be integrated.\n\nLooking at my MEMORY.md, the key findings that should be part of the Hermes system are the trading skills matrix, chanlun-agent MVP, smart data router, multi-channel protocol, and the czsc extension layer. But since I can't actually push to GitHub, I'll draft the integration files and test what I can locally.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好，船长。我来把关键发现整合进 Hermes 体系，先做文件准备，再测试同步。\n\n**整合计划：**\n1. 将交易助手核心能力打包为 Hermes Skill\n2. 将关键记忆同步到 hermes-sync 记忆层\n3. 测试同步流程\n\n开始干活 👇"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_628e3071e1754eb1809672e4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 先测试 GitHub 连接\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer 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\" \"https://api.github.com/repos/xianfanhuang/hermes-skills\" 2>&1 | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\nr = json.load(sys.stdin)\nprint(f'✅ 连接正常: {r[\\\"full_name\\\"]} (private: {r[\\\"private\\\"]})')\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":405,"output":854,"cacheRead":52096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53355,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779483160973}}
