{"type":"message","id":"ab3324b3","parentId":"077cff2a","timestamp":"2026-05-22T20:52:56.911Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_87b9cde9f41d4dd9b04fdde8","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"name: token-budget-manager\ndescription: 跨域复用的主动上下文Token消耗管理。基于output/input 2.5倍价差的真实成本模型，监控输出膨胀、工具结果长度、群聊噪音，主动预警和降级。所有Agent session通用。\nversion: 2.0.0\nlicense: MIT\ntags: [成本控制, Token管理, 主动监控, 跨域复用, Output优化]\n\n# Token Budget Manager v2.0\n\n> 🛡️ 主动防线——不是等你发现烧钱了才补救，而是在烧钱之前拦截\n>"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":625,"aggregated":"name: token-budget-manager\ndescription: 跨域复用的主动上下文Token消耗管理。基于output/input 2.5倍价差的真实成本模型，监控输出膨胀、工具结果长度、群聊噪音，主动预警和降级。所有Agent session通用。\nversion: 2.0.0\nlicense: MIT\ntags: [成本控制, Token管理, 主动监控, 跨域复用, Output优化]\n\n# Token Budget Manager v2.0\n\n> 🛡️ 主动防线——不是等你发现烧钱了才补救，而是在烧钱之前拦截\n>","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779483176909}}
{"type":"message","id":"78990109","parentId":"ab3324b3","timestamp":"2026-05-22T20:52:59.691Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create the trading-assistant skill. I'll create it in a local temp directory first, then push it to GitHub.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_14740492179843b4bf270207","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /tmp/hermes-trading-skill"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":407,"output":87,"cacheRead":53056,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53550,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779483176912}}
