{"type":"message","id":"9d4e9d5f","parentId":"2fe24cf5","timestamp":"2026-05-22T20:55:36.464Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The integration is complete. Let me now write a summary for VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## ✅ 整合完成\n\n### hermes-skills（技能仓库）\n- 新增 `trading-assistant/` 目录\n- `SKILL.md` — 技能主文件（缠论/数据路由/风控/反思引擎）\n- `knowledge/` — 缠论规则 + 存在本体论映射\n- `config/` — 风控参数 + 数据源路由配置\n- `README.md` — 技能清单已更新\n\n### hermes-sync（中央存储）\n- `memory/MEMORY.md` — 新增交易助手整合摘要（v2.1）\n- `memory/sync.json` — 同步标记已更新\n\n### 验证结果\n- 两个仓库各有 6 个新提交\n- 文件结构完整，无冲突\n- 同步标记一致\n\n---\n\n**下一步可选动作：**\n1. 将交易知识库接入 Hermes 的 Session 归档系统\n2. 部署 P2 Cloudflare Workers 后，交易分析会话自动归档\n3. 本地 chanlun-agent 可通过 hermes-sync 拉取最新技能配置\n\n船长，测试通过 ✅ 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":680,"output":292,"cacheRead":63104,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64076,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779483330402}}
