{"type":"message","id":"bba16ad6","parentId":"12409bf9","timestamp":"2026-05-22T20:59:54.085Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is warning me about memory/session contamination. This is an important concern - I need to make sure that my local workspace memory (MEMORY.md, daily notes, etc.) doesn't get mixed up with the Hermes central memory, and that different session contexts don't bleed into each other.\n\nLet me think about what could be contaminated:\n1. My local MEMORY.md has trading-specific content that shouldn't pollute the central Hermes memory\n2. The hermes-sync MEMORY.md should be a clean, shared state\n3. My session context (feishu trading assistant) shouldn't mix with Top Sailor's Coze session\n\nLet me check what I pushed to hermes-sync MEMORY.md to make sure it's clean and doesn't contain session-specific data that would contaminate other platforms.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好提醒，船长。让我检查一下刚才推送的内容，确保没有污染。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ddc882b180a143cd980b844c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 检查 hermes-sync MEMORY.md 内容，看是否有不该有的会话数据\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer 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\" \"https://api.github.com/repos/xianfanhuang/hermes-sync/contents/memory/MEMORY.md\" 2>&1 | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys, base64\nr = json.load(sys.stdin)\ncontent = base64.b64decode(r['content']).decode('utf-8')\n# 检查是否有敏感/会话污染的内容\nissues = []\nif 'ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683' in content:\n    issues.append('⚠️ 包含飞书 open_id')\nif 'github_pat_' in content:\n    issues.append('⚠️ 包含 GitHub Token')\nif 'feishu' in content.lower():\n    issues.append('⚠️ 包含渠道特定信息')\nif '当前会话' in content:\n    issues.append('⚠️ 包含会话状态')\n\nif issues:\n    for i in issues:\n        print(i)\nelse:\n    print('✅ 无明显污染')\nprint()\nprint('--- 内容摘要 ---')\nfor line in content.split('\\n'):\n    if line.strip():\n        p