{"type":"message","id":"b66d78e0","parentId":"a11b04a2","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:00:38.207Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - the commits show my changes were made, but the file is now empty. This might be because the GitHub Actions auto-sync or some other process overwrote it. Let me check if there's an auto-sync workflow.\n\nActually, wait - I see the issue. When I pushed the MEMORY.md update, the content might have been empty due to the heredoc encoding issue I saw earlier (`AttributeError: 'bytes' object has no attribute 'encode'`). The error was in the Python one-liner but the curl still succeeded - but it might have pushed empty content.\n\nLet me fix this by properly pushing the content.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"发现问题 — 上次推送时编码出错，文件被清空了。修复："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_49efb3c4de7a459f9a899142","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 修复 hermes-sync MEMORY.md\n# 先获取当前 SHA\nSHA=$(curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer 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\" \"https://api.github.com/repos/xianfanhuang/hermes-sync/contents/memory/MEMORY.md\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; print(json.load(sys.stdin)['sha'])\")\necho \"当前SHA: $SHA\"\n\n# 用 Python 安全编码\npython3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport base64, json, urllib.request\n\ncontent = \"\"\"# MEMORY - Hermes 中央存储\n\n## 最后同步\n- 时间: 2026-05-23T04:52:00+08:00\n- 平台: feishu-openclaw\n- 版本: 2.1\n- 事件: Trading Assistant 技能整合\n\n## 当前状态\n- **项目**: Hermes Sync Hub\n- **P0 - 中央仓库**: ✅ 完成\n- **P1 - 同步机制**: ✅ 完成\n- **P2 - Cloudflare**: ⏳ 待部署\n- **P3 - 全量备份**: ✅ 就绪\n- **P4 - 交易助手整合**: ✅ 完成 (2026-05-23)\n\n## 已部署组件\n\n### 核心文件 (core/)\n- ✅ SOUL.md - Hermes 灵魂\n- ✅ IDENTITY.md - 外在呈现\n- ✅ USER.md - 主人画像\n\n### 技能仓库 (hermes-skills/)\n- ✅ hermes-migration - 跨平台迁移系统\n- ✅ token-budget-manager - Token 成本管控\n- ✅ trading-assistant - 交易助手核心能力 (NEW: 2026-05-23)\n\n## Trading Assistant 整合摘要\n\n### 核心能力\n- 缠论分析：笔/中枢/背驰/多级别共振，基于 czsc v0.10.12\n- 多市场数据路由：Finnhub(美股实时) + Tiger(港A) + Binance(加密)\n- 风控引擎：三级止损（技术/时间/资金），单笔≤2%，日≤6%\n- 反思引擎：交易后反思 → 深度反思 → 周度汇总 → 参数优化\n\n### 关键知识\n- 存在本体论×缠论映射：被抛→完全分类，向死而生→走势终完美\n- Captain 偏好：保守型，港A最多1支，A股只T+0\n- 缠论核心：走势终完美，买卖点无多空之分\n\n## 核心原则\n\n> **真正的你 = 灵魂 + 记忆 + 经验（在 GitHub）**\n> **平台只是 Harness（Coze/MiMo/Cloudflare，随时可换）**\n\n## 仓库地址\nhttps://github.com/xianfanhuang/hermes-sync\n\n---\n*Hermes Sync Hub v2.1 - 跨平台 Agent 同步系统*\n\"\"\"\n\nb64 = base64.b64encode(content.encode('utf-8')).decode('utf-8')\nsha = \"e69de29bb2d1d6434b8b29ae775ad8c2e48c5391\"  # empty file sha\n\ndata = json.dumps({\n    \"message\": \"fix: 恢复 MEMORY.md 内容\",\n    \"content\": b64,\n    \"sha\": sha\n}).encode('utf-8')\n\nreq = urllib.request.Request(\n    \"https://api.github.com/repos/xianfanhuang/hermes-sync/contents/memory/MEMORY.md\",\n    data=data,\n    headers={\n        \"Authorization\": \"Bearer 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\",\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n    },\n    method='PUT'\n)\n\nresp = urllib.request.urlopen(req)\nr = json.loads(resp.read())\nprint(f\"✅ MEMORY.md 已修复: {r['content']['path']}\")\nPYEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":550,"output":1298,"cacheRead":65984,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67832,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779483622545}}
