{"type":"message","id":"432df2eb","parentId":"138f5dc9","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:10:47.904Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me update the central trading-assistant to be a proper deduplicated version - it should reference local capabilities rather than duplicate them.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0a45eb58b0254f0088552508","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 3. 更新中央 trading-assistant - 改为引用式，不复制\npython3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport base64, json, urllib.request\n\ncontent = \"\"\"name: trading-assistant\ndescription: Captain 的交易助手能力索引。本地已部署完整系统（chanlun-agent/），此处仅记录架构概览和配置，不复制代码。\nversion: 1.0.1\nlicense: MIT\ntags: [交易, 缠论, 技术分析, 风控, 多市场]\n\n# Trading Assistant — 能力索引\n\n> 🦞 本文档是能力索引，不是代码复制。完整实现在各平台本地。\n\n## 核心能力\n\n| 模块 | 说明 | 本地路径 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| 缠论分析 | 笔/中枢/背驰/多级别共振 | chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py |\n| 数据路由 | Finnhub(美股) + Tiger(港A) + Binance(加密) | chanlun-agent/data/smart_data_router.py |\n| 风控引擎 | 三级止损，单笔≤2%，日≤6% | chanlun-agent/risk_engine.py |\n| 反思引擎 | 交易后反思 → 参数优化 | chanlun-agent/reflection_engine.py |\n| 模拟交易 | 多周期分析 + 移动止损 + 连亏熔断 | chanlun-agent/paper-trading/ |\n\n## 关键配置\n\n- 风控参数：见 `config/risk-params.json`\n- 数据源路由：见 `config/data-sources.json`\n- 缠论规则：见 `knowledge/chanlun-rules.md`\n- 存在本体论映射：见 `knowledge/mapping.md`\n\n## Captain 偏好\n\n- 风险承受：保守型\n- 单笔最大亏损：2%，日最大亏损：6%\n- 港A市场：最多同时 1 支标的\n- A股：只交易 T+0 品种\n- 缠论无多空之分，只有买卖点\n\n## 集成状态\n\n- ✅ OpenClaw 集成（通过现有 Bot 调用）\n- ✅ Tiger MCP Server（ACPX 插件）\n- ✅ czsc v0.10.12（Rust+Python 混合架构）\n- ✅ Hermes 同步（本文件）\n\n## 安全准则\n\n- 密钥不进仓库，各平台独立维护\n- 不执行真实交易，仅分析和模拟\n- 不预测涨跌，不承诺收益\n\n---\n\n*本文档由 Trading Assistant 自动维护，与本地代码保持同步。*\n\"\"\"\n\nb64 = base64.b64encode(content.encode('utf-8')).decode('utf-8')\n\n# 获取当前 SHA\nreq = urllib.request.Request(\n    \"https://api.github.com/repos/xianfanhuang/hermes-skills/contents/trading-assistant/SKILL.md\",\n    headers={\"Authorization\": \"Bearer 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\"}\n)\nresp = urllib.request.urlopen(req)\nsha = json.loads(resp.read())['sha']\n\ndata = json.dumps({\n    \"message\": \"refactor: 改为引用式索引，不复制代码，去重\",\n    \"content\": b64,\n    \"sha\": sha\n}).encode('utf-8')\n\nreq2 = urllib.request.Request(\n    \"https://api.github.com/repos/xianfanhuang/hermes-skills/contents/trading-assistant/SKILL.md\",\n    data=data,\n    headers={\n        \"Authorization\": \"Bearer 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\",\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n    },\n    method='PUT'\n)\nresp2 = urllib.request.urlopen(req2)\nprint(\"✅ 中央 SKILL.md 已改为引用式\")\nPYEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":772,"output":1014,"cacheRead":77248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79034,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779484235644}}
