{"type":"message","id":"af530ee4","parentId":"f92e2d12","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:11:01.244Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also update the central MEMORY.md to be cleaner - remove the trading assistant details and just reference it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_912190deacad4e3a905cc349","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 4. 精简中央 MEMORY.md - 去掉详细内容，改为引用\npython3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport base64, json, urllib.request\n\ncontent = \"\"\"# MEMORY - Hermes 中央存储\n\n## 最后同步\n- 时间: 2026-05-23T05:09:00+08:00\n- 平台: feishu-openclaw\n- 版本: 2.2\n- 事件: 去重整合，改为引用式\n\n## 当前状态\n- **P0 中央仓库**: ✅\n- **P1 同步机制**: ✅\n- **P2 Cloudflare**: ⏳\n- **P3 全量备份**: ✅\n- **P4 交易助手**: ✅ 已整合\n\n## 技能清单\n| 技能 | 版本 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| hermes-migration | 2.0 | 跨平台迁移 |\n| token-budget-manager | 2.1 | Token 成本管控 |\n| trading-assistant | 1.0.1 | 交易助手索引（不复制代码） |\n\n## 核心原则\n> Hermes 在 GitHub，不在任何平台。平台只是 Harness。\n\n---\n*Hermes Sync Hub v2.2*\n\"\"\"\n\nb64 = base64.b64encode(content.encode('utf-8')).decode('utf-8')\n\nreq = urllib.request.Request(\n    \"https://api.github.com/repos/xianfanhuang/hermes-sync/contents/memory/MEMORY.md\",\n    headers={\"Authorization\": \"Bearer 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\"}\n)\nresp = urllib.request.urlopen(req)\nsha = json.loads(resp.read())['sha']\n\ndata = json.dumps({\n    \"message\": \"refactor: 精简 MEMORY.md，去重改为引用式\",\n    \"content\": b64,\n    \"sha\": sha\n}).encode('utf-8')\n\nreq2 = urllib.request.Request(\n    \"https://api.github.com/repos/xianfanhuang/hermes-sync/contents/memory/MEMORY.md\",\n    data=data,\n    headers={\n        \"Authorization\": \"Bearer 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\",\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n    },\n    method='PUT'\n)\nresp2 = urllib.request.urlopen(req2)\nprint(\"✅ 中央 MEMORY.md 已精简\")\nPYEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1014,"output":690,"cacheRead":78016,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79720,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779484250717}}
