{"type":"message","id":"bbd0c14c","parentId":"82a517f5","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:20:30.660Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_cbd0132eae2d4809900ce7c9","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== sessions/README.md ===\n# Session 数据管理\n\n## 目录结构\n\n```\nsessions/\n├── index/\n│   └── session_index.json       # 会话索引（时间线+关键词）\n├── raw/                         # 原始对话（分块存储）\n│   └── 2026-05/\n│       └── 2026-05-22/\n│           ├── session_20260522_093033_001.json\n│           └── ...\n└── summaries/                   # 会话摘要\n    └── 2026-05/\n        └── 2026-05-22/\n            └── session_20260522_093033_summary.md\n```\n\n## 分块规则（防错乱/防断层）\n\n| 触发条件 | 操作 |\n|---------|------|\n| 消息数达到50条 | 生成新chunk |\n| 时间间隔30分钟 | 生成新chunk |\n| 会话正常结束 | 标记complete |\n| 会话异常中断 | 标记incomplete，下次续传 |\n\n## Chunk格式\n\n```json\n{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"session_20260522_093033_001\",\n  \"session_id\": \"session_20260522_093033\",\n  \"platform\": \"coze\",\n  \"message_range\": [1, 50],\n  \"message_count\": 50,\n  \"checksum\": \"sha256:abc123...\",\n  \"prev_chunk\": null,\n  \"next_chunk\": \"session_20260522_093033_002\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"timestamp_start\": \"2026-05-22T09:30:33+08:00\",\n  \"timestamp_end\": \"2026-05-22T09:38:15+08:00\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\"id\": 1, \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"...\", \"timestamp\": \"...\"},\n    {\"id\": 2, \"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"...\", \"timestamp\": \"...\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## 索引格式\n\n```json\n{\n  \"session_id\": \"session_20260522_093033\",\n  \"platform\": \"coze\",\n  \"start_time\": \"2026-05-22T09:30:33+08:00\",\n  \"end_time\": \"2026-05-22T09:45:12+08:00\",\n  \"message_count\": 127,\n  \"chunks\": [\"001\", \"002\", \"003\"],\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"summary_key\": \"hermes_migration_p2\",\n  \"keywords\": [\"hermes\", \"migration\", \"mimo\", \"github\"]\n}\n```"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":697,"aggregated":"=== sessions/