{"type":"message","id":"4f3cf60a","parentId":"ce4fbd63","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:21:02.567Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a complete picture. Let me summarize for VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## Session 归档设计（当前状态）\n\n### 架构设计 ✅\n\n```\nsessions/\n├── index/session_index.json    ← 主索引（时间线+关键词）  ✅ 已创建，空\n├── raw/2026-05/22/             ← 原始对话分块存储         ⏳ 目录未创建\n└── summaries/2026-05/22/       ← 会话摘要                 ⏳ 目录未创建\n```\n\n### 分块规则\n\n| 触发条件 | 操作 |\n|---------|------|\n| 消息 ≥50 条 | 新 chunk |\n| 间隔 ≥30 分钟 | 新 chunk |\n| 正常结束 | 标记 complete |\n| 异常中断 | 标记 incomplete，下次续传 |\n\n### 已实现的 API（sync_client_v2.py）\n\n| 函数 | 功能 |\n|------|------|\n| `session_start(platform, context)` | 开始新会话，生成 session_id |\n| `session_store_chunk(session_id, messages)` | 存储分块，自动计算 checksum |\n| `session_end(session_id, summary, keywords)` | 结束会话，写入索引 |\n| `session_query(platform, date, keywords)` | 按条件查询会话 |\n| `session_restore(session_id, last_n)` | 恢复上下文（链式校验） |\n\n### Cloudflare Workers（P2 待部署）\n\n6 个 API 端点已设计：\n- `POST /api/session/start`\n- `POST /api/session/chunk`\n- `POST /api/session/end`\n- `GET /api/session/query`\n- `GET /api/session/restore`\n- `GET /api/session/verify`\n\n### 当前实际情况\n\n- **索引文件**：已创建，0 条会话\n- **原始数据**：无（raw/ 目录未创建）\n- **实际归档**：❌ 未运行过\n- **阻塞项**：P2 Cloudflare Workers 未部署\n\n---\n\n**总结**：设计完成，代码就绪，但**没有实际数据归档过**。需要要么部署 Cloudflare Workers 走 API，要么直接用 sync_client_v2.py 的本地模式跑起来。\n\n船长想先走哪条路？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":392,"output":541,"cacheRead":88768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89701,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779484854737}}
