{"type":"message","id":"cc8dfd12","parentId":"d9630457","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:23:18.494Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me give VAN a summary of the usage.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## 本地 Session 归档 — 使用方式\n\n```bash\ncd /workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/hermes-sync-core\n\n# 开始会话\npython3 session_local.py start feishu \"今日交易分析\"\n\n# 存储消息（可多次调用）\npython3 session_local.py store <session_id> '[{\"id\":1,\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"...\"}]'\n\n# 结束会话\npython3 session_local.py end <session_id> \"摘要\" '[\"关键词\"]'\n\n# 列出会话\npython3 session_local.py list [日期]\n\n# 恢复上下文\npython3 session_local.py restore <session_id> [最后N条]\n```\n\n**特性：**\n- 自动按日期分目录：`sessions/raw/2026/05/23/`\n- chunk 自动链式关联（prev/next 指针）\n- SHA256 校验防篡改\n- 关键词索引支持检索\n\n**下一步可选：**\n1. 接入自动归档 — 会话结束时自动调用\n2. 同步到 GitHub — 本地归档后 push 到 hermes-sync\n3. 接入 Cron 定时归档\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":276,"output":298,"cacheRead":94528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95102,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779484992839}}
