{"type":"message","id":"831e626d","parentId":"3868aa74","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:26:02.439Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking about the relationship between session archiving and the \"token bridge skill\", and what the link chain looks like.\n\nLet me think about this:\n1. Token Budget Manager - manages token consumption/costs\n2. Session Archiving - archives conversation sessions\n3. How do they relate?\n\nThe relationship is:\n- When a session gets too long (>30 rounds yellow, >50 rounds red), the Token Budget Manager triggers archiving\n- The Session Archive stores the conversation history\n- After archiving, the session can be cleared/reset, saving tokens\n\nLet me also check if there's a \"token bridge\" skill specifically - I don't recall seeing one. Maybe VAN is referring to the token-budget-manager, or maybe there's something I missed.\n\n\nI should look through the available skills to see if there's a dedicated token bridge skill I'm not aware of, or if VAN is using that term to describe how the two systems connect.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_46acce1cc85849e78ecb71ee","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 检查是否有 token bridge 相关内容\necho \"=== 搜索 token bridge ===\"\ngrep -rn \"bridge\\|token.*bridge\\|Bridge\" /workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/ --include=\"*.md\" --include=\"*.py\" 2>/dev/null | head -10\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 中央仓库搜索 ===\"\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer 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\" \"https://api.github.com/search/code?q=bridge+repo:xianfanhuang/hermes-skills\" 2>&1 | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\nr = json.load(sys.stdin)\nprint(f'结果数: {r.get(\\\"total_count\\\", 0)}')\nfor item in r.get('items', []):\n    print(f'  {item[\\\"path\\\"]}')\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":588,"outp