{"type":"message","id":"8e3d42fd","parentId":"186a9664","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:26:12.580Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's no \"token bridge\" skill. VAN might be asking about the relationship between token budget management and session archiving - how they connect. Let me explain the link chain.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"中央库里没有 \"token bridge\" 这个技能。你是指 **Token Budget Manager 和 Session 归档之间的联动关系**？\n\n如果是，链路是这样的：\n\n```\nToken Budget Manager (成本管控)\n        │\n        │ 检测到阈值\n        ▼\n┌───────────────────┐\n│ L1 自检           │\n│ 轮次 >30 → 黄色   │──── 触发 ────→ Session 归档\n│ 轮次 >50 → 红色   │                │\n│ output >1K → 黄色 │                ▼\n└───────────────────┘         ┌──────────────┐\n                              │ session_local │\n                              │ .py           │\n                              │ 1. start      │\n                              │ 2. store      │\n                              │ 3. end        │\n                              └──────┬───────┘\n                                     │\n                                     ▼\n                              ┌──────────────┐\n                              │ sessions/    │\n                              │ raw/2026/    │\n                              │ summaries/   │\n                              └──────────────┘\n                                     │\n                                     ▼\n                              ┌──────────────┐\n                              │ /new (重置)  │\n                              │ 上下文清空   │\n                              │ Token 回收   │\n                              └──────────────┘\n```\n\n**完整链路：**\n\n1. **Token Budget Manager** 每轮自检（轮次/output长度/工具调用）\n2. 触到黄色预警 → 提醒归档\n3. 触到红色熔断 → 强制归档 + 拒绝后续请求\n4. **Session 归档** → 保存对话历史到本地/GitHub\n5. 归档完成后 → `/new` 开新会话，上下文清空，Token 成本重置\n\n**本质：Token Manager 是触发器，Session Archive 是执行器，两者是\"检测→动作\"的关系。**\n\n船长说的 token bridge 是这个意思，还是有个我没看到的独立技能？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":497,"output":532,"cacheRead":95360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96389,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779485163193}}
