{"type":"message","id":"62f8d92e","parentId":"f4b93ad2","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:33:15.835Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_eafd6bb15ad9448d85790613","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== hermes-skills/trading-assistant/knowledge ===\nchanlun-rules.md\nmapping.md\n\n=== chanlun-agent/knowledge ===\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/B-practices/2026-05-20_CRCL_long_loss.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/B-practices/2026-05-21_SOXS_long_loss.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/B-practices/reflection_template.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/G-guides/signal_sop.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/R-rules/bi_rules.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/R-rules/zs_rules.md"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":6,"aggregated":"=== hermes-skills/trading-assistant/knowledge ===\nchanlun-rules.md\nmapping.md\n\n=== chanlun-agent/knowledge ===\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/B-practices/2026-05-20_CRCL_long_loss.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/B-practices/2026-05-21_SOXS_long_loss.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/B-practices/reflection_template.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/G-guides/signal_sop.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/R-rules/bi_rules.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/knowledge/R-rules/zs_rules.md","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779485595833}}
{"type":"message","id":"18f21bc2","parentId":"62f8d92e","timestamp":"2026-05-22T21:33:25.878Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can clearly see the difference. Let me summarize for VAN.\n\nThe chanlun-agent knowledge base has a structured R-G-B system:\n- R-rules: Technical rules (bi_rules, zs_rules)\n- G-guides: Operational guides (signal_sop)\n- B-practices: Practice records (trade reflections)\n\nWhile the hermes-skills/trading-assistant/knowledge is a simplified reference:\n- chanlun-rules.md: Summary of core rules\n- mapping.md: Philosophy mapping\n\nThese are different approaches to knowledge organization.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## 两个知识库对比\n\n### chanlun-agent/knowledge（本地实战知识库）\n\n```\nknowledge/\n├── R-rules/          # 规则层 — 缠论技术规则\n│   ├── bi_rules.md   # 笔规则\n│   └── zs_rules.md   # 中枢规则\n├── G-guides/         # 指南层 — 操作流程\n│   └── signal_sop.md # 信号SOP\n└── B-practices/      # 实践层 — 交易复盘\n    ├── 2026-05-20_CRCL_long_loss.md\n    ├── 2026-05-21_SOXS_long_loss.md\n    └── reflection_template.md\n```\n\n**特点：**\n- **RGB 三层结构**（Rules → Guides → Practices）\n- 包含**实战数据**（具体交易复盘）\n- **动态增长**（每次交易自动写入）\n- 与代码紧密耦合（czsc_extension 直接引用）\n\n### hermes-skills/trading-assistant/knowledge（中央索引知识库）\n\n```\nknowledge/\n├── chanlun-rules.md  # 核心规则摘要\n└── mapping.md        # 存在本体论映射\n```\n\n**特点：**\n- **静态摘要**（不随交易更新）\n- **跨平台通用**（任何平台可读）\n- **引用式**（不复制完整规则）\n- **哲学层**（存在本体论映射）\n\n---\n\n## 核心区别\n\n| 维度 | chanlun-agent | hermes-skills |\n|------|---------------|---------------|\n| **定位** | 实战知识库 | 索引/摘要 |\n| **结构** | RGB 三层 | 扁平文件 |\n| **数据** | 含交易复盘 | 无实战数据 |\n| **更新** | 动态（交易后自动写入） | 静态（手动同步） |\n| **耦合** | 与代码紧密 | 与代码解耦 |\n| **适用** | 本地分析决策 | 跨平台迁移/共享 |\n\n---\n\n## 关系\n\n```\nchanlun-agent/knowledge (实战)\n    │\n    │ 提炼/脱敏\n    ▼\nhermes-skills/trading-assistant/knowledge (索引)\n    │\n    │ 跨平台共享\n    ▼\nCoze / MiMo / 其他平台\n```\n\n**不是替代关系，是上下游关系** — 本地知识库是源，中央知识库是摘要。\n\n船长觉得这个结构需要调整吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":362,"output":798,"cacheRead":103424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104584,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779485595838}}
