{"type":"message","id":"6ef3fa62","parentId":"76caf3bb","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:06:23.256Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants me to describe the full chain from triggering archiving to starting a new session, from my (Trading Assistant's) perspective.\n\nLet me think about this:\n\n1. Token Budget Manager detects threshold (yellow/red)\n2. Archiving is triggered\n3. Session data is saved\n4. Context is cleared\n5. New session starts\n\nLet me trace through the actual code and flow to give an accurate picture.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8b912a45691c4d278094f3f5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 查看当前 AGENTS.md 中的归档规则\ngrep -A 20 \"红色熔断\\|归档\\|/new\" /workspace/projects/workspace/AGENTS.md | head -25"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1013,"output":238,"cacheRead":103744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104995,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779487578555}}
{"type":"message","id":"bdb0dfc2","parentId":"6ef3fa62","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:06:23.266Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_8b912a45691c4d278094f3f5","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"| 指标 | 黄色预警 | 红色熔断 |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| 对话轮次 | >30轮 | >50轮 |\n| 单轮 output 长度 | >1K字 | >2K字 |\n| 单轮工具调用 | >8次 | >15次 |\n\n**核心原则：**\n- **轻量第一**：≤3句话能说清的事，不要写一段\n- **output 单价 = 2.5×input** → 回复≤5行最高效\n- 工具结果裁剪：search 用 short/medium，read_file 用 limit\n- 禁止在主对话做长文生成 → 交子 session\n- 主对话 >50轮 → 自动归档，拒绝后续请求\n\n**轻量回复规范：**\n- ✅ 一句话回复、直接给结论、用列表代替段落\n- ❌ 重复确认已知信息、\"让我为您总结一下...\"\n\n## 📊 Trading Skills 已安装\n\n| Skill | 功能 |\n|-------|------|\n| Trading | 技术分析、图表模式、风险管理教育 |\n| Auto Trading Strategy | 预测市场策略、加密货币策略 |\n| Backtest Expert | 专业回测方法论、过拟合预防 |\n| Crypto Backtest | 加密货币期货回测引擎 |"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":4,"aggregated":"| 指标 | 黄色预警 | 红色熔断 |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| 对话轮次 | >30轮 | >50轮 |\n| 单轮 output 长度 | >1K字 | >2K字 |\n| 单轮工具调用 | >8次 | >15次 |\n\n**核心原则：**\n- **轻量第一**：≤3句话能说清的事，不要写一段\n- **output 单价 = 2.5×input** → 回复≤5行最高效\n- 工具结果裁剪：search 用 short/medium，read_file 用 limit\n- 禁止在主对话做长文生成 → 交子 session\n- 主对话 >50轮 → 自动归档，拒绝后续请求\n\n**轻量回复规范：**\n- ✅ 一句话回复、直接给结论、用列表代替段落\n- ❌ 重复确认已知信息、\"让我为您总结一下...\"\n\n## 📊 Trading Skills 已安装\n\n| Skill | 功能 |\n|-------|------|\n| Trading | 技术分析、图表模式、风险管理教育 |\n| Auto Trading Strategy | 预测市场策略、加密货币策略 |\n| Backtest Expert | 专业回测方法论、过拟合预防 |\n| Crypto Backtest | 加密货币期货回测引擎 |","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779487583263}}
