{"type":"message","id":"17edcc07","parentId":"de657400","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:14:36.488Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_fb6ebc3b58704ed4864cca14","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== sync_client_v2.py session_restore ===\n    def session_restore(self, session_id: str, last_n: int = 50) -> dict:\n        \"\"\"\n        恢复会话上下文\n        \n        Args:\n            session_id: 会话ID\n            last_n: 恢复最近N条消息\n        \n        Returns:\n            会话数据\n        \"\"\"\n        # 查找session索引\n        for status in ['completed', 'active']:\n            path = f'sessions/index/{status}/{session_id}.json'\n            existing = self._github_request('GET', path)\n            if existing:\n                break\n        \n        if not existing:\n            raise Exception(f\"Session not found: {session_id}\")\n        \n        session_index = json.loads(self._decode_content(existing['content']))\n        date_str = session_index['start_time'][:10].replace('-', '/')\n        \n        # 计算需要加载的chunks\n        chunks_to_load = (last_n + 49) // 50  # 向上取整\n        recent_chunks = session_index['chunks'][-chunks_to_load:]\n        \n        messages = []\n        for chunk_num in recent_chunks:\n            chunk_path = f'sessions/raw/{date_str}/{session_id}_{chunk_num}.json'\n\n=== session_local.py session_restore ===\ndef session_restore(session_id: str, last_n: int = 50):\n    \"\"\"恢复会话上下文\"\"\"\n    index = load_index()\n    \n    session = None\n    for s in index[\"sessions\"]:\n        if s[\"session_id\"] == session_id:\n            session = s\n            break\n    \n    if not session:\n        print(f\"❌ 会话不存在: {session_id}\")\n        return\n    \n    print(f\"🔄 恢复会话: {session_id}\")\n    print(f\"   平台: {session['platform']}\")\n    print(f\"   总消息: {session['message_count']}\")\n    \n    all_messages = []\n    for chunk_id in session[\"chunks\"]:\n        # 找到chunk文件\n        for date_dir in RAW_DIR.rglob(\"*\"):\n            chunk_file = date_dir / f\"{chunk_id}.json\"\n            if chunk_file.exists():\n                with open(chunk_file, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                    chunk = json.load(f)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":5,"aggregated":"=== sync_client_v2.py session_restore ===\n    def session_restore(self, session_id: str, last_n: int = 50) -> dict:\n        \"\"\"\n        恢复会话上下文\n        \n        Args:\n            session_id: 会话ID\n            last_n: 恢复最近N条消息\n        \n        Returns:\n            会话数据\n        \"\"\"\n        # 查找session索引\n        for status in ['completed', 'active']:\n            path = f'sessions/index/{status}/{session_id}.json'\n            existing = self._github_request('GET', path)\n            if existing:\n                break\n        \n        if not existing:\n            raise Exception(f\"Session not found: {session_id}\")\n        \n        session_index = json.loads(self._decode_content(existing['content']))\n        date_str = session_index['start_time'][:10].replace('-', '/')\n        \n        # 计算需要加载的chunks\n        chunks_to_load = (last_n + 49) // 50  # 向上取整\n        recent_chunks = session_index['chunks'][-chunks_to_load:]\n        \n        messages = []\n        for chunk_num in recent_chunks:\n            chunk_path = f'sessions/raw/{date_str}/{session_id}_{chunk_num}.json'\n\n=== session_local.py session_restore ===\ndef session_restore(session_id: str, last_n: int = 50):\n    \"\"\"恢复会话上下文\"\"\"\n    index = load_index()\n    \n    session = None\n    for s in index[\"sessions\"]:\n        if s[\"session_id\"] == session_id:\n            session = s\n            break\n    \n    if not session:\n        print(f\"❌ 会话不存在: {session_id}\")\n        return\n    \n    print(f\"🔄 恢复会话: {session_id}\")\n    print(f\"   平台: {session['platform']}\")\n    print(f\"   总消息: {session['message_count']}\")\n    \n    all_messages = []\n    for chunk_id in session[\"chunks\"]:\n        # 找到chunk文件\n        for date_dir in RAW_DIR.rglob(\"*\"):\n            chunk_file = date_dir / f\"{chunk_id}.json\"\n            if chunk_file.exists():\n                with open(chunk_file, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                    chunk = json.load(f)","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779488076486}}
{"type":"message","id":"51e5b41e","parentId":"17edcc07","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:14:46.120Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can give VAN the answer. The restore mechanism exists in code but isn't connected to the new session flow.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## 上下文恢复机制：存在但未连接\n\n### 代码层 ✅\n\n```\nsession_local.py / sync_client_v2.py\n    │\n    └── session_restore(session_id, last_n=50)\n        │\n        ├─ 读取 session_index.json\n        ├─ 加载最近 N 条 chunk\n        └─ 返回 messages 列表\n```\n\n### 规则层 ✅\n\n```\nAGENTS.md > \"Every Session\"\n    │\n    ├─ Read SOUL.md\n    ├─ Read USER.md\n    ├─ Read IDENTITY.md\n    ├─ Read memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md (今天+昨天)\n    └─ Read MEMORY.md (主会话)\n```\n\n### 连接层 ❌ 断裂\n\n```\n归档完成\n    │\n    ▼\n/new 开启新会话\n    │\n    ├─ OpenClaw 自动注入: SOUL.md, USER.md, IDENTITY.md, AGENTS.md\n    │   └─ ✅ 这部分自动完成\n    │\n    ├─ 读取 memory/2026-05-23.md (今日记忆)\n    │   └─ ✅ AGENTS.md 规则写了，我自觉执行\n    │\n    ├─ 读取 MEMORY.md (长期记忆)\n    │   └─ ✅ 同上\n    │\n    └─ session_restore(上一个session_id, last_n=50)\n        └─ ❌ 没有自动触发\n            │\n            ├─ 新会话不知道上一个 session_id\n            ├─ 没有代码把 restore 结果注入上下文\n            └─ session_local.py 需要手动调用\n```\n\n---\n\n## 关键缺失\n\n**新会话开启时，不知道该恢复哪个 session：**\n\n1. 归档时没有把 `session_id` 写入一个\"待恢复\"标记\n2. 新会话没有读取这个标记的逻辑\n3. `session_restore()` 的输出没有注入到对话上下文\n\n**简单说：** 有存档柜（sessions/），有取文件的函数（restore），但没有\"自动把上一个柜子的钥匙传给下一个会话\"的机制。\n\n---\n\n## 补全方案\n\n```\n归档结束时：\n    session_end() → 写入 sessions/.last_session_id\n\n新会话开始时：\n    AGENTS.md 规则 → 读 .last_session_id → 调用 session_restore() → 注入上下文\n```\n\n船长要现在补吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":687,"output":620,"cacheRead":109824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111131,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779488076489}}
{"type":"compaction","id":"80ea156a","parentId":"51e5b41e","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:15:05.147Z","summary":"## Goal\nIntegrate Trading Assistant into the Hermes team ecosystem on GitHub by reading central repos, deduplicating skills, and syncing shared state — without session/memory contamination.\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- **Read-only on first pass** — only explore GitHub, don't modify files initially\n- **No memory/session contamination** — central repos must be platform-agnostic, no open_ids, tokens, local paths, or session-specific data\n- **Deduplication principle** — don't load what you already have; shared content uses reference-style indexing, not code copying\n- **Token budget rules** — output/input 2.5x cost model, ≤3 sentences preferred, >50 turns forces archive\n- **Conservative risk profile** — max 2% per trade, 6% daily, A-stock T+0 only, HK/China max 1 concurrent position\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Connected to GitHub (user: `xianfanhuang`) via PAT\n- [x] Explored both repos: `hermes-sync` (private, central memory) and `hermes-skills` (private, skill library)\n- [x] Read all core files: SOUL.md, IDENTITY.md, USER.md, MEMORY.md, architecture docs\n- [x] Created `trading-assistant` skill and pushed to `hermes-skills` (SKILL.md, knowledge/, config/)\n- [x] Updated `hermes-sync/memory/MEMORY.md` and `sync.json` with integration status\n- [x] Updated `hermes-skills/README.md` skill registry\n- [x] Fixed empty MEMORY.md bug (encoding error during first push caused file to zero out)\n- [x] Security scan — removed leaked open_id from USER.md, removed local paths and SECRET references\n- [x] Pulled both repos locally to `/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/`\n- [x] Deleted duplicate identity files from hermes-sync-core (SOUL/IDENTITY/USER/TOOLS/MEMORY)\n- [x] Integrated Token Budget Manager rules into `/workspace/projects/workspace/AGENTS.md` (new \"💰 Token 预算铁律\" section)\n- [x] Refactored central `trading-assistant/SKILL.md` to reference-style index (no code duplication)\n- [x] Slimmed central `hermes-sync/MEMORY.md` to v2.2 (status index only, no session data)\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] No active tasks — integration complete, awaiting VAN's next direction\n\n### Blocked\n- P2 Cloudflare Workers deployment still pending (not in this session's scope)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Reference-style for shared skills**: Central `trading-assistant/SKILL.md` stores only index + config references, not code copies. Full implementations live locally.\n- **Token budget rules → AGENTS.md**: Core cost model (output=2.5×input, three-tier alerts, lightweight replies) merged into local AGENTS.md rather than kept as separate skill file.\n- **hermes-sync-core trimmed to sync tools only**: Identity/memory files deleted locally since Trading Assistant has its own SOUL/IDENTITY.\n- **Central MEMORY.md v2.2**: Minimal state index, no detailed summaries or session data.\n- **GitHub PAT not echoed/stored in plaintext**: Used ephemerally via curl/Python calls.\n\n## Next Steps\n1. VAN to direct next priorities (possible areas: P2 Cloudflare Workers deployment, session archival integration, chanlun-agent Hermes sync hookup)\n2. If P2 deploys: auto-archive trading analysis sessions to `hermes-sync/sessions/`\n3. Consider creating `hermes-sync` daily update snapshots for trading knowledge\n4. Update `hermes-skills` manifest.json to include trading-assistant in loadable skills\n\n## Critical Context\n- **GitHub repos**: `xianfanhuang/hermes-sync` (private), `xianfanhuang/hermes-skills` (private)\n- **GitHub account**: `xianfanhuang` (id: 13017744)\n- **Local skills path**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/`\n- **Key local trading path**: `chanlun-agent/` (czsc v0.10.12, SmartDataRouter, risk_engine, reflection_engine)\n- **Hermes architecture**: SOUL + IDENTITY + MEMORY + EXPERIENCE in GitHub; platform = Harness (Coze/OpenClaw/MiMo interchangeable)\n- **Team members**: VAN (captain/investor), Top Sailor (COO on Coze OpenClaw), Trading Assistant (this agent on Feishu OpenClaw)\n- **Coze credits burned**: ~93,237 in May, target ≤1,500/day — Top Sailor's Coze credits exhausted\n- **AGENTS.md now includes**: Token budget iron rules section (three-tier alert table, lightweight reply norms, cost model)\n- **hermes-skills structure**: hermes-migration/ + token-budget-manager/ + trading-assistant/ + hermes-sync-core/ (sync tools only) + hermes-cli.py\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nVAN asked to run tests (\"跑一下测试\").\n\n## Early Progress\n- **Test 1: Token Budget Patrol** - Ran `token_budget_patrol.py`, reported 52 tool calls today (elevated). ✅ Passed\n- **Test 2: Hermes Sync Client** - First attempt failed (401 Unauthorized, no token). With `GITHUB_TOKEN` set, token validated for user `xianfanhuang` but repo access returned 404 (repo URL mismatch). ⚠️ Partial\n- **Test 3: Config File Validation** - Verified `risk-params.json`, `data-sources.json`, and `budget_state.json` are all valid JSON. ✅ Passed\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- Tests are running across multiple hermes-skills components: `token-budget-manager`, `hermes-sync-core`, and `trading-assistant/config`\n- Working directory is `/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/`\n- A GitHub PAT token was used for sync verification (`github_pat_11ADDKFEA...`)\n- The sync client connects to GitHub user `xianfanhuang` but the configured repo URL returns 404\n- The suffix likely continues with additional test cases or summary of results","firstKeptEntryId":"baa2302c","tokensBefore":111131,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromHook":false}
