{"type":"message","id":"db934a00","parentId":"208278bf","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:17:46.927Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the full picture. The central hermes-sync has:\n1. core/ — identity files (SOUL, IDENTITY, USER, TOOLS, MEMORY)\n2. sessions/ — session archives (with session_restore function)\n3. sync_client_v2.py — the sync tool with session management\n\nThe restore mechanism in the central repo is the same as what I showed — session_restore() exists in code, but there's no automatic trigger to call it when a new session starts.\n\nThe \"Every Session\" rule in AGENTS.md is what tells the agent to read the identity files and memory. This is the same pattern across all Hermes platforms.\n\nSo yes, the central skills have the same gap.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## 是的，中央技能也是同样的断裂\n\n### 中央 hermes-sync 结构\n\n```\nhermes-sync/\n├── core/                    # 灵魂文件\n│   ├── SOUL.md\n│   ├── IDENTITY.md\n│   ├── USER.md\n│   ├── TOOLS.md\n│   └── MEMORY.md\n├── sessions/                # 会话归档\n│   ├── index/session_index.json\n│   └── raw/summaries/\n└── sync_client_v2.py        # 同步工具\n    ├── pull_core()          # 拉取灵魂文件\n    ├── push_core()          # 推送灵魂文件\n    ├── session_start()\n    ├── session_store_chunk()\n    ├── session_end()\n    ├── session_restore()    # ← 代码就绪\n    └── verify_continuity()\n```\n\n### 恢复链路对比\n\n| 环节 | 我（Trading Assistant） | 中央 Hermes |\n|------|------------------------|-------------|\n| 灵魂文件注入 | OpenClaw 自动加载 AGENTS.md/SOUL.md 等 | ✅ 同样机制 |\n| 读取 memory/ | AGENTS.md 规则，Agent 自觉执行 | ✅ 同样规则 |\n| session_restore() | 代码存在，未自动触发 | ✅ 代码存在，同样未触发 |\n| 传递 session_id | ❌ 无机制 | ❌ 无机制 |\n| restore 结果注入 | ❌ 无机制 | ❌ 无机制 |\n\n### 核心问题\n\n**\"Every Session\" 规则只覆盖了静态文件（SOUL/MEMORY），没有覆盖动态上下文（session 归档数据）。**\n\n```\n当前：/new → 读 SOUL.md ✅ → 读 MEMORY.md ✅ → session_restore() ❌\n应该：/new → 读 SOUL.md ✅ → 读 MEMORY.md ✅ → session_restore() ✅\n```\n\n### 补全需要做的事\n\n1. **session_end() 时** → 写入 `.last_session_id` 到 core/ 或 sessions/\n2. **AGENTS.md \"Every Session\" 规则** → 增加一步：读 `.last_session_id`，调用 restore\n3. **restore 输出** → 作为上下文注入对话开头\n\n**本质上就是 AGENTS.md 多加一条规则 + session_end 多写一个文件。**\n\n船长要现在补吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":235,"output":827,"cacheRead":64320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65382,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779488256174}}
