{"type":"message","id":"d1019594","parentId":"f9831798","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:22:50.188Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_eccea4cad1ee4097a2526398","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 补全验证 ===\n\n1. session_local.py - resume 函数\n1\n\n2. session_local.py - .last_session_id 写入\n6\n\n3. AGENTS.md - Every Session 第6步\n6. **恢复上一个会话上下文**（如存在）:\n   ```bash\n   # 恢复上一个会话摘要\n   cd /workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/hermes-sync-core\n   python3 session_local.py resume 30\n   ```\n\n4. GitHub 推送状态\n  文件: session_local.py\n  大小: 10602 bytes\n  URL: https://github.com/xianfanhuang/hermes-skills/blob/master/hermes-sync-core/session_local.py"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":856,"aggregated":"=== 补全验证 ===\n\n1. session_local.py - resume 函数\n1\n\n2. session_local.py - .last_session_id 写入\n6\n\n3. AGENTS.md - Every Session 第6步\n6. **恢复上一个会话上下文**（如存在）:\n   ```bash\n   # 恢复上一个会话摘要\n   cd /workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/hermes-sync-core\n   python3 session_local.py resume 30\n   ```\n\n4. GitHub 推送状态\n  文件: session_local.py\n  大小: 10602 bytes\n  URL: https://github.com/xianfanhuang/hermes-skills/blob/master/hermes-sync-core/session_local.py","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779488570186}}
{"type":"message","id":"df127ed8","parentId":"d1019594","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:22:56.507Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All verified. Let me give VAN the summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## ✅ 补全完成\n\n### 修改内容\n\n| 文件 | 改动 |\n|------|------|\n| `session_local.py` | + `session_resume()` 函数，自动读取并清除 `.last_session_id` |\n| `session_local.py` | `session_end()` 结束时写入 `.last_session_id` |\n| `AGENTS.md` | Every Session 新增第6步：`python3 session_local.py resume 30` |\n| `sync_client_v2.py` | + `session_resume()` 方法（中央版本） |\n| GitHub | 两个文件已推送 |\n\n### 完整链路（现在）\n\n```\n归档触发\n    │\n    ▼\nsession_end(session_id, summary, keywords)\n    │\n    ├─ 保存摘要到 sessions/summaries/\n    ├─ 更新索引到 sessions/index/\n    └─ 写入 sessions/.last_session_id  ← 新增\n    │\n    ▼\n/new 开启新会话\n    │\n    ├─ OpenClaw 自动加载 SOUL/USER/IDENTITY/AGENTS.md\n    ├─ AGENTS.md 第6步触发\n    │   └─ python3 session_local.py resume 30  ← 新增\n    │       ├─ 读取 .last_session_id\n    │       ├─ 恢复最近30条消息\n    │       ├─ 清除标记（防重复）\n    │       └─ 输出摘要\n    └─ Agent 读取 memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md + MEMORY.md\n```\n\n### 验证结果\n\n```\nstart → store → end → .last_session_id ✅ → resume → 清除 ✅ → 再次resume → 📭无记录 ✅\n```\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":550,"output":409,"cacheRead":72512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73471,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779488570190}}
{"type":"message","id":"beafa657","parentId":"df127ed8","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:32:43.276Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e39d66edca8c4e0b96b0abbee0\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-23 06:32 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e39d66edca8c4e0b96b0abbee0]\nVAN: 我觉得应该把上下文恢复作为一个重要专门的可复用skill独立出来。你认为呢"}],"timestamp":1779489163270}}
{"type":"message","id":"bb685893","parentId":"beafa657","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:32:52.095Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is suggesting that the context restoration mechanism should be extracted into a standalone, reusable skill rather than being embedded in session_local.py and AGENTS.md. Let me think about this.\n\nPros of making it a standalone skill:\n1. Reusable across different Hermes platforms (Coze, MiMo, etc.)\n2. Can be independently versioned and updated\n3. Clear separation of concerns\n4. Other agents can load it without understanding session_local.py internals\n5. Can work with different storage backends (local files, GitHub API, etc.)\n\nCons:\n1. Adds another skill to manage\n2. The current implementation is simple enough that a full skill might be overkill\n\n\n3. I need to think about whether this complexity is justified given the scope of the project.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"同意，理由：\n\n**独立 Skill 的价值：**\n1. **跨平台复用** — Coze/MiMo/其他 Agent 都需要同样的恢复逻辑\n2. **关注点分离** — session_local.py 管存储，resume skill 管恢复策略\n3. **版本独立** — 恢复逻辑可以单独迭代（比如未来加嵌入检索、摘要压缩等）\n4. **降低耦合** — AGENTS.md 只需 `加载 context-restore skill`，不用写 shell 脚本\n\n**建议结构：**\n\n```\nhermes-skills/\n├── context-restore/           # 新 Skill\n│   ├── SKILL.md              # 恢复规则 + 接口定义\n│   ├── restore.py            # 恢复引擎（读 .last_session_id → 加载chunk → 输出摘要）\n│   └── config.json           # 恢复策略配置（last_n、压缩方式等）\n├── token-budget-manager/\n├── hermes-migration/\n└── ...\n```\n\n**AGENTS.md 变成：**\n```\n6. 加载 context-restore skill（如存在），自动恢复上一个会话\n```\n\n**未来扩展空间：**\n- 嵌入式语义检索（不只返回 last_n 条）\n- 摘要压缩（超长会话只返回关键决策）\n- 多会话关联（恢复相关主题的历史会话）\n\n要现在拆吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":719,"output":633,"cacheRead":73024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":74376,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779489163275}}
