{"type":"message","id":"29a98e74","parentId":"2bb37598","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:43:51.303Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me give VAN the final summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## ✅ 全链路打通\n\n### 完整链路\n\n```\nToken Budget Manager (检测)\n    │ 轮次>30 / output>1K / 工具>8\n    ▼\nSession 归档 (session_local.py)\n    │ session_end() → 写入 .last_session_id\n    ▼\n/new 开启新会话\n    │\n    ▼\nContext Restore (restore.py)\n    │ 读取 .last_session_id\n    │ 恢复摘要 + 最近消息 + 关键词\n    │ 清除标记（防重复）\n    ▼\nAgent 继续工作（带着上下文）\n```\n\n### 修改清单\n\n| 文件 | 改动 |\n|------|------|\n| `context-restore/SKILL.md` | 新建 — Skill 定义 |\n| `context-restore/restore.py` | 新建 — 恢复引擎 |\n| `context-restore/config.json` | 新建 — 配置 |\n| `AGENTS.md` | Every Session 第6步改为调用 restore.py |\n| `skill-manifest.json` | 新增 context-restore |\n| `hermes-sync/MEMORY.md` | v2.3，新增技能 |\n| `hermes-sync/sync.json` | v2.3，同步标记 |\n| `session_local.py` | session_end 写入 .last_session_id |\n\n### 测试结果\n\n```\nToken Budget     ✅  巡检正常\nSession 归档     ✅  start→store→end→.last_session_id 写入\nContext Restore  ✅  auto→恢复摘要/消息/关键词→清除标记\n重复恢复防护    ✅  第二次→📭无记录\n恢复历史        ✅  记录到 .restore_history\n配置管理        ✅  config.json 可调参数\nGitHub 推送     ✅  4个新文件 + 2个更新\n```\n\n### Skill 优先级\n\n```\nhermes-migration        100  (最高，迁移用)\ntoken-budget-manager     90  (成本管控)\ncontext-restore          85  (上下文恢复) ← 新增\ntrading-assistant        80  (交易索引)\n```\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":222,"output":517,"cacheRead":83328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84067,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779489822715}}
