{"type":"message","id":"ab8a83fa","parentId":"41e74ca9","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:52:48.498Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_44e5862f20e244e09eb0efe6","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Session 数据管理\n\n## 目录结构\n\n```\nsessions/\n├── index/\n│   └── session_index.json       # 会话索引（时间线+关键词）\n├── raw/                         # 原始对话（分块存储）\n│   └── 2026-05/\n│       └── 2026-05-22/\n│           ├── session_20260522_093033_001.json\n│           └── ...\n└── summaries/                   # 会话摘要\n    └── 2026-05/\n        └── 2026-05-22/\n            └── session_20260522_093033_summary.md\n```\n\n## 分块规则（防错乱/防断层）\n\n| 触发条件 | 操作 |\n|---------|------|\n| 消息数达到50条 | 生成新chunk |\n| 时间间隔30分钟 | 生成新chunk |\n| 会话正常结束 | 标记complete |\n| 会话异常中断 | 标记incomplete，下次续传 |\n\n## Chunk格式\n\n```json\n{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"session_20260522_093033_001\",\n  \"session_id\": \"session_20260522_093033\",\n  \"platform\": \"coze\",\n  \"message_range\": [1, 50],\n  \"message_count\": 50,\n  \"checksum\": \"sha256:abc123...\",\n  \"prev_chunk\": null,\n  \"next_chunk\": \"session_20260522_093033_002\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"timestamp_start\": \"2026-05-22T09:30:33+08:00\",\n  \"timestamp_end\": \"2026-05-22T09:38:15+08:00\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\"id\": 1, \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"...\", \"timestamp\": \"...\"},\n    {\"id\": 2, \"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"...\", \"timestamp\": \"...\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## 索引格式\n\n```json\n{\n  \"session_id\": \"session_20260522_093033\",\n  \"platform\": \"coze\",\n  \"start_time\": \"2026-05-22T09:30:33+08:00\",\n  \"end_time\": \"2026-05-22T09:45:12+08:00\",\n  \"message_count\": 127,\n  \"chunks\": [\"001\", \"002\", \"003\"],\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"summary_key\": \"hermes_migration_p2\",\n  \"keywords\": [\"hermes\", \"migration\", \"mimo\", \"github\"]\n}\n```"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":654,"aggregated":"# Session 数据管理\n\n## 目录结构\n\n```\nsessions/\n├── index/\n│   └── session_index.json       # 会话索引（时间线+关键词）\n├── raw/                         # 原始对话（分块存储）\n│   └── 2026-05/\n│       └── 2026-05-22/\n│           ├── session_20260522_093033_001.json\n│           └── ...\n└── summaries/                   # 会话摘要\n    └── 2026-05/\n        └── 2026-05-22/\n            └── session_20260522_093033_summary.md\n```\n\n## 分块规则（防错乱/防断层）\n\n| 触发条件 | 操作 |\n|---------|------|\n| 消息数达到50条 | 生成新chunk |\n| 时间间隔30分钟 | 生成新chunk |\n| 会话正常结束 | 标记complete |\n| 会话异常中断 | 标记incomplete，下次续传 |\n\n## Chunk格式\n\n```json\n{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"session_20260522_093033_001\",\n  \"session_id\": \"session_20260522_093033\",\n  \"platform\": \"coze\",\n  \"message_range\": [1, 50],\n  \"message_count\": 50,\n  \"checksum\": \"sha256:abc123...\",\n  \"prev_chunk\": null,\n  \"next_chunk\": \"session_20260522_093033_002\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"timestamp_start\": \"2026-05-22T09:30:33+08:00\",\n  \"timestamp_end\": \"2026-05-22T09:38:15+08:00\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\"id\": 1, \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"...\", \"timestamp\": \"...\"},\n    {\"id\": 2, \"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"...\", \"timestamp\": \"...\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## 索引格式\n\n```json\n{\n  \"session_id\": \"session_20260522_093033\",\n  \"platform\": \"coze\",\n  \"start_time\": \"2026-05-22T09:30:33+08:00\",\n  \"end_time\": \"2026-05-22T09:45:12+08:00\",\n  \"message_count\": 127,\n  \"chunks\": [\"001\", \"002\", \"003\"],\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"summary_key\": \"hermes_migration_p2\",\n  \"keywords\": [\"hermes\", \"migration\", \"mimo\", \"github\"]\n}\n```","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779490368496}}
{"type":"message","id":"c704fc34","parentId":"ab8a83fa","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:52:53.791Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also check the original sync_client_v2.py for the session_restore function.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_faf054630ba84d9baf8d0c17","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 获取原始 sync_client_v2.py 的 session_restore\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer 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\" \"https://api.github.com/repos/xianfanhuang/hermes-sync/contents/sync_client_v2.py\" | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys, base64\nr = json.load(sys.stdin)\ncontent = base64.b64decode(r['content']).decode('utf-8')\n# 找 session_restore 函数\nlines = content.split('\\n')\nin_func = False\nfor i, line in enumerate(lines):\n    if 'def session_restore' in line:\n        in_func = True\n    if in_func:\n        print(f'{i:3}: {line}')\n        if i > 0 and line.strip() and not line.startswith(' ') and not line.startswith('\\t') and 'def ' in line:\n            break\n    if in_func and i > 460:\n        break\n\" 2>&1 | head -50"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":963,"output":320,"cacheRead":84736,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":86019,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779490368501}}
{"type":"message","id":"57788487","parentId":"c704fc34","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:52:54.721Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_faf054630ba84d9baf8d0c17","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"393:     def session_restore(self, session_id: str, last_n: int = 50) -> dict:\n394:         \"\"\"\n395:         恢复会话上下文\n396:         \n397:         Args:\n398:             session_id: 会话ID\n399:             last_n: 恢复最近N条消息\n400:         \n401:         Returns:\n402:             会话数据\n403:         \"\"\"\n404:         # 查找session索引\n405:         for status in ['completed', 'active']:\n406:             path = f'sessions/index/{status}/{session_id}.json'\n407:             existing = self._github_request('GET', path)\n408:             if existing:\n409:                 break\n410:         \n411:         if not existing:\n412:             raise Exception(f\"Session not found: {session_id}\")\n413:         \n414:         session_index = json.loads(self._decode_content(existing['content']))\n415:         date_str = session_index['start_time'][:10].replace('-', '/')\n416:         \n417:         # 计算需要加载的chunks\n418:         chunks_to_load = (last_n + 49) // 50  # 向上取整\n419:         recent_chunks = session_index['chunks'][-chunks_to_load:]\n420:         \n421:         messages = []\n422:         for chunk_num in recent_chunks:\n423:             chunk_path = f'sessions/raw/{date_str}/{session_id}_{chunk_num}.json'\n424:             chunk_data = self._github_request('GET', chunk_path)\n425:             if chunk_data:\n426:                 chunk = json.loads(self._decode_content(chunk_data['content']))\n427:                 messages.extend(chunk['messages'])\n428:         \n429:         return {\n430:             'session_id': session_id,\n431:             'platform': session_index['platform'],\n432:             'message_count': len(messages),\n433:             'messages': messages[-last_n:]\n434:         }\n435:     \n436:     def verify_continuity(self, session_id: str) -> dict:\n437:         \"\"\"\n438:         验证会话连续性\n439:         \n440:         Returns:\n441:             验证结果\n442:         \"\"\""}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":922,"aggregated":"393:     def session_restore(self, session_id: str, last_n: int = 50) -> dict:\n394:         \"\"\"\n395:         恢复会话上下文\n396:         \n397:         Args:\n398:             session_id: 会话ID\n399:             last_n: 恢复最近N条消息\n400:         \n401:         Returns:\n402:             会话数据\n403:         \"\"\"\n404:         # 查找session索引\n405:         for status in ['completed', 'active']:\n406:             path = f'sessions/index/{status}/{session_id}.json'\n407:             existing = self._github_request('GET', path)\n408:             if existing:\n409:                 break\n410:         \n411:         if not existing:\n412:             raise Exception(f\"Session not found: {session_id}\")\n413:         \n414:         session_index = json.loads(self._decode_content(existing['content']))\n415:         date_str = session_index['start_time'][:10].replace('-', '/')\n416:         \n417:         # 计算需要加载的chunks\n418:         chunks_to_load = (last_n + 49) // 50  # 向上取整\n419:         recent_chunks = session_index['chunks'][-chunks_to_load:]\n420:         \n421:         messages = []\n422:         for chunk_num in recent_chunks:\n423:             chunk_path = f'sessions/raw/{date_str}/{session_id}_{chunk_num}.json'\n424:             chunk_data = self._github_request('GET', chunk_path)\n425:             if chunk_data:\n426:                 chunk = json.loads(self._decode_content(chunk_data['content']))\n427:                 messages.extend(chunk['messages'])\n428:         \n429:         return {\n430:             'session_id': session_id,\n431:             'platform': session_index['platform'],\n432:             'message_count': len(messages),\n433:             'messages': messages[-last_n:]\n434:         }\n435:     \n436:     def verify_continuity(self, session_id: str) -> dict:\n437:         \"\"\"\n438:         验证会话连续性\n439:         \n440:         Returns:\n441:             验证结果\n442:         \"\"\"","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779490374717}}
{"type":"message","id":"44e4f220","parentId":"57788487","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:53:05.685Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the original design. Let me create a comparison table.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## 原方案 vs 实现 对比\n\n### Session 存储层\n\n| 维度 | 原方案 (README.md) | 当前实现 | 差异 |\n|------|-------------------|---------|------|\n| 分块触发 | ≥50条 或 ≥30分钟 | 手动调用 store | ⚠️ 无自动触发 |\n| Chunk 格式 | 完整（含 prev/next 指针） | ✅ 完全一致 | ✅ |\n| 索引结构 | session_index.json | ✅ 完全一致 | ✅ |\n| 链式校验 | checksum + prev/next | ✅ 完全一致 | ✅ |\n| 状态标记 | complete/incomplete | ✅ complete/active | ✅ |\n| 异常恢复 | incomplete → 下次续传 | ❌ 未实现 | ⚠️ |\n\n### Session 恢复层\n\n| 维度 | 原方案 (sync_client_v2) | 当前实现 (context-restore) | 差异 |\n|------|------------------------|---------------------------|------|\n| 恢复函数 | `session_restore(id, last_n)` | ✅ `restore_session(id, last_n)` | ✅ |\n| 加载策略 | 按 chunk 加载，向上取整 | ✅ 遍历 chunk 加载 | ✅ |\n| 返回内容 | session_id + platform + messages | ✅ +summary +keywords +time | ✅ 增强 |\n| 自动触发 | ❌ 无 | ✅ `restore.py auto` | ✅ 新增 |\n| 标记传递 | ❌ 无 | ✅ `.last_session_id` | ✅ 新增 |\n| 重复防护 | ❌ 无 | ✅ 读取后自动清除 | ✅ 新增 |\n| 压缩策略 | ❌ 无 | ✅ `compress_messages()` | ✅ 新增 |\n| 恢复历史 | ❌ 无 | ✅ `.restore_history` | ✅ 新增 |\n| 配置化 | ❌ 硬编码 | ✅ `config.json` | ✅ 新增 |\n\n### 链路完整性\n\n| 环节 | 原方案 | 当前实现 |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| Token Budget 检测 | 设计了规则 | ✅ AGENTS.md 规则 + patrol.py |\n| 归档触发 | 设计了阈值 | ⚠️ 规则存在，无自动代码 |\n| Session 存储 | 代码就绪 | ✅ session_local.py |\n| **上下文恢复** | **❌ 只有函数，无触发** | **✅ auto + .last_session_id** |\n| 新会话注入 | ❌ 无机制 | ✅ AGENTS.md 第6步 |\n\n---\n\n## 关键差异总结\n\n**原方案缺的，现在补上了：**\n1. ✅ `.last_session_id` 标记传递\n2. ✅ `auto` 自动恢复模式\n3. ✅ 重复恢复防护\n4. ✅ 消息压缩策略\n5. ✅ 恢复历史追踪\n6. ✅ 配置化参数\n\n**仍然缺的（原方案也没实现）：**\n1. ⚠️ 自动分块触发（≥50条/≥30分钟）\n2. ⚠️ 异常中断恢复（incomplete → 续传）\n3. ⚠️ Token Budget → 归档的自动触发\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":894,"output":808,"cacheRead":85696,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87398,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779490374722}}
{"type":"message","id":"b64b60b5","parentId":"44e4f220","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:59:15.887Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e39b2f984a0c242a37a92004f1\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-23 06:59 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e39b2f984a0c242a37a92004f1]\nVAN: 深入理解原方案的底层思想，补全没实现的，再次整合优化，本地验证，中央更新"}],"timestamp":1779490755884}}
{"type":"message","id":"caf8d517","parentId":"b64b60b5","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:59:24.937Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants me to:\n1. Deep understand the original design philosophy\n2. Implement the missing pieces (auto-chunking, incomplete recovery, Token Budget auto-trigger)\n3. Integrate and optimize\n4. Local verification\n5. Push to central\n\nLet me start by deeply understanding the original design philosophy from the README and code.\n\nThe original design has these key ideas:\n1. **Chunking** - Break sessions into manageable pieces (50 msgs or 30 min) to prevent data loss and enable partial recovery\n2. **Chain linking** - prev/next pointers ensure continuity and detect corruption\n3. **Checksum** - SHA256 for data integrity\n4. **Status tracking** - complete/incomplete for crash recovery\n\n\n5. **Indexing** - Fast lookup by time, keywords, platform\n\nNow I'm looking at the actual implementation gaps: the chunking logic isn't automatically triggered, incomplete sessions don't get resumed, and the Token Budget Manager isn't wired to trigger archiving when thresholds are hit. I need to implement auto-chunking in the storage function, add incomplete session recovery, and connect the Token Budget system to the archiving mechanism.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a3ca3bdb82894b97b2d63f07","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 深入理解原方案设计 - 查看所有相关文件\necho \"=== 原方案核心文件 ===\"\ncurl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer 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\" \"https://api.github.com/repos/xianfanhuang/hermes-sync/contents/sync_client_v2.py\" | python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys, base64\nr = json.load(sys.stdin)\ncontent = base64.b64decode(r['content']).decode('utf-8')\nprint(content)\n\" > /tmp/sync_client_v2_original.py\n\necho \"=== session_start ===\"\ngrep -n -A 35 \"def session_start\" /tmp/sync_client_v2_original.py\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== session_store_chunk ===\"\ngrep -n -A 60 \"def session_store_chunk\" /tmp/sync_client_v2_original.py\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== session_end ===\"\ngrep -n -A 60 \"def session_end\" /tmp/sync_client_v2_original.py\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== verify_continuity ===\"\ngrep -n -A 50 \"def verify_continuity\" /tmp/sync_client_v2_original.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1152,"output":809,"cacheRead":86528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88489,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779490755886}}
{"type":"message","id":"45d8f7ba","parentId":"caf8d517","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:59:25.835Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_a3ca3bdb82894b97b2d63f07","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 原方案核心文件 ===\n=== session_start ===\n144:    def session_start(self, platform: str, context: str = '') -> str:\n145-        \"\"\"\n146-        开始新会话\n147-        \n148-        Returns:\n149-            session_id: 会话唯一标识\n150-        \"\"\"\n151-        session_id = f\"session_{datetime.now().strftime('%Y%m%d_%H%M%S')}\"\n152-        \n153-        session_index = {\n154-            'session_id': session_id,\n155-            'platform': platform,\n156-            'start_time': datetime.now().isoformat(),\n157-            'end_time': None,\n158-            'message_count': 0,\n159-            'chunks': [],\n160-            'status': 'active',\n161-            'context': context\n162-        }\n163-        \n164-        # 保存到GitHub\n165-        path = f'sessions/index/active/{session_id}.json'\n166-        data = {\n167-            'message': f'Start session {session_id}',\n168-            'content': self._encode_content(json.dumps(session_index, indent=2))\n169-        }\n170-        \n171-        result = self._github_request('PUT', path, data)\n172-        if result:\n173-            print(f\"✅ Session started: {session_id}\")\n174-            return session_id\n175-        else:\n176-            raise Exception(\"Failed to start session\")\n177-    \n178-    def session_store_chunk(self, session_id: str, messages: List[dict], \n179-                           platform: str, chunk_num: int = 1) -> dict:\n\n=== session_store_chunk ===\n178:    def session_store_chunk(self, session_id: str, messages: List[dict], \n179-                           platform: str, chunk_num: int = 1) -> dict:\n180-        \"\"\"\n181-        存储会话分块\n182-        \n183-        Args:\n184-            session_id: 会话ID\n185-            messages: 消息列表\n186-            platform: 平台标识\n187-            chunk_num: 块序号\n188-        \n189-        Returns:\n190-            chunk信息\n191-        \"\"\"\n192-        chunk_id = f\"{session_id}_{chunk_num:03d}\"\n193-        date_str = datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d')\n194-        \n195-        # 构建chunk数据\n196-        start_msg_id = messages[0].get('id', 1)\n197-        end_msg_id = messages[-1].get('id', len(messages))\n198-        \n199-        chunk_data = {\n200-            'chunk_id': chunk_id,\n201-            'session_id': session_id,\n202-            'platform': platform,\n203-            'message_range': [start_msg_id, end_msg_id],\n204-            'message_count': len(messages),\n205-            'checksum': self._calculate_checksum({'messages': messages}),\n206-            'prev_chunk': f\"{session_id}_{chunk_num-1:03d}\" if chunk_num > 1 else None,\n207-            'next_chunk': None,\n208-            'status': 'complete',\n209-            'timestamp_start': messages[0].get('timestamp', datetime.now().isoformat()),\n210-            'timestamp_end': messages[-1].get('timestamp', datetime.now().isoformat()),\n211-            'messages': messages\n212-        }\n213-        \n214-        # 保存chunk\n215-        chunk_path = f'sessions/raw/{date_str.replace(\"-\", \"/\")}/{chunk_id}.json'\n216-        result = self._github_request('PUT', chunk_path, {\n217-            'message': f'Store chunk {chunk_id}',\n218-            'content': self._encode_content(json.dumps(chunk_data, indent=2))\n219-        })\n220-        \n221-        if not result:\n222-            raise Exception(f\"Failed to store chunk {chunk_id}\")\n223-        \n224-        # 更新session索引\n225-        index_path = f'sessions/index/active/{session_id}.json'\n226-        existing = self._github_request('GET', index_path)\n227-        \n228-        if existing:\n229-            session_index = json.loads(self._decode_content(existing['content']))\n230-            session_index['chunks'].append(f\"{chunk_num:03d}\")\n231-            session_index['message_count'] = end_msg_id\n232-            session_index['end_time'] = datetime.now().isoformat()\n233-            \n234-            self._github_request('PUT', index_path, {\n235-                'message': f'Update session {session_id}',\n236-                'content': self._encode_content(json.dumps(session_index, indent=2)),\n237-                'sha': existing['sha']\n238-            })\n\n=== session_end ===\n248:    def session_end(self, session_id: str, summary: str = '', keywords: List[str] = None):\n249-        \"\"\"\n250-        结束会话\n251-        \n252-        Args:\n253-            session_id: 会话ID\n254-            summary: 会话摘要\n255-            keywords: 关键词列表\n256-        \"\"\"\n257-        # 获取活跃session\n258-        active_path = f'sessions/index/active/{session_id}.json'\n259-        existing = self._github_request('GET', active_path)\n260-        \n261-        if not existing:\n262-            raise Exception(f\"Active session not found: {session_id}\")\n263-        \n264-        session_index = json.loads(self._decode_content(existing['content']))\n265-        session_index['status'] = 'complete'\n266-        session_index['end_time'] = datetime.now().isoformat()\n267-        session_index['summary'] = summary\n268-        session_index['keywords'] = keywords or []\n269-        \n270-        # 移动到completed目录\n271-        completed_path = f'sessions/index/completed/{session_id}.json'\n272-        self._github_request('PUT', completed_path, {\n273-            'message': f'Complete session {session_id}',\n274-            'content': self._encode_content(json.dumps(session_index, indent=2))\n275-        })\n276-        \n277-        # 保存摘要\n278-        if summary:\n279-            date_str = session_index['start_time'][:10].replace('-', '/')\n280-            summary_path = f'sessions/summaries/{date_str}/{session_id}_summary.md'\n281-            summary_content = f\"\"\"# Session Summary: {session_id}\n282-\n283-## Platform\n284-{session_index['platform']}\n285-\n286-## Duration\n287-{session_index['start_time']} ~ {session_index['end_time']}\n288-\n289-## Messages\n290-{session_index['message_count']} messages\n291-\n292-## Summary\n293-{summary}\n294-\n295-## Keywords\n296-{chr(10).join(f'- {k}' for k in (keywords or []))}\n297-\"\"\"\n298-            self._github_request('PUT', summary_path, {\n299-                'message': f'Add summary for {session_id}',\n300-                'content': self._encode_content(summary_content)\n301-            })\n302-        \n303-        # 更新主索引\n304-        self._update_main_index(session_index)\n305-        \n306-        print(f\"✅ Session ended: {session_id}\")\n307-    \n308-    def _update_main_index(self, session_index: dict):\n\n=== verify_continuity ===\n437:    def verify_continuity(self, session_id: str) -> dict:\n438-        \"\"\"\n439-        验证会话连续性\n440-        \n441-        Returns:\n442-            验证结果\n443-        \"\"\"\n444-        # 查找session\n445-        for status in ['completed', 'active']:\n446-            path = f'sessions/index/{status}/{session_id}.json'\n447-            existing = self._github_request('GET', path)\n448-            if existing:\n449-                break\n450-        \n451-        if not existing:\n452-            return {'error': f'Session not found: {session_id}'}\n453-        \n454-        session_index = json.loads(self._decode_content(existing['content']))\n455-        date_str = session_index['start_time'][:10].replace('-', '/')\n456-        \n457-        issues = []\n458-        last_message_id = 0\n459-        \n460-        for chunk_num in session_index['chunks']:\n461-            chunk_path = f'sessions/raw/{date_str}/{session_id}_{chunk_num}.json'\n462-            chunk_data = self._github_request('GET', chunk_path)\n463-            \n464-            if not chunk_data:\n465-                issues.append(f\"Missing chunk: {chunk_num}\")\n466-                continue\n467-            \n468-     