{"type":"message","id":"d23af9bc","parentId":"1b962612","timestamp":"2026-05-22T23:03:03.926Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me give VAN the final summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## ✅ 完整实现并验证\n\n### 原方案核心思想 vs 实现\n\n| 原方案设计 | 实现状态 |\n|-----------|---------|\n| **分块防错乱** — ≥50条/≥30分钟自动切块 | ✅ MessageBuffer 自动分块 |\n| **链式校验** — prev/next + SHA256 | ✅ 完全一致 |\n| **active/completed 分离** — 崩溃恢复 | ✅ 两目录结构 |\n| **异常恢复** — incomplete → 续传 | ✅ `recover()` 自动恢复缓冲区 |\n| **Token Budget 联动** — 阈值触发归档 | ✅ `checkpoint()` 三级响应 |\n| **上下文恢复** — 新会话读取上一个 | ✅ `resume()` + `.last_session_id` |\n\n### 测试结果 (27/27)\n\n```\n📦 自动分块     ✅ 60条 → 50+10，自动触发\n📦 手动刷新     ✅ flush 剩余10条\n🔍 连续性验证   ✅ 2块/60条/校验通过/无间隙\n🏁 结束会话     ✅ active→completed，写入.last_session_id\n🔄 恢复         ✅ 摘要+消息+关键词\n🔄 重复恢复     ✅ 📭无记录\n💰 Token Budget ✅ ok→warn→force_flush 三级响应\n🔧 异常恢复     ✅ 缓冲区消息自动写入chunk\n🔗 完整链路     ✅ start→push→end→resume\n```\n\n### 中央仓库更新\n\n| 仓库 | 文件 | 版本 |\n|------|------|------|\n| hermes-skills | session_manager.py | v2.0 |\n| hermes-skills | context-restore/ | v1.0 |\n| hermes-skills | skill-manifest.json | 更新 |\n| hermes-sync | MEMORY.md | v2.4 |\n| hermes-sync | sync.json | v2.4 |\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":129,"output":485,"cacheRead":108800,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109414,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779490976123}}
