{"type":"message","id":"a3262bcc","parentId":"23494ff6","timestamp":"2026-05-22T23:30:25.374Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me give VAN the final summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## ✅ 闭环打通\n\n### 完整链路\n\n```\nToken Budget Patrol (token_budget_patrol.py)\n    │ 检测到红色 (轮次>50)\n    ▼\ntrigger_session_checkpoint()\n    │ subprocess 调用 session_manager.py checkpoint\n    ▼\nSession Manager checkpoint()\n    │ _restore_buffers_from_disk() ← 从磁盘恢复缓冲区\n    │ flush(\"token_budget_red\") ← 强制写入chunk\n    ▼\n缓冲区清除 → chunk 写入 → 数据安全\n\n    ... 用户执行 /new ...\n\nAGENTS.md 第6步\n    ▼\nsession_manager.py resume 30\n    │ 读取 .last_session_id\n    │ 恢复摘要 + 消息 + 关键词\n    ▼\n上下文恢复完成\n```\n\n### 闭环验证\n\n```\nToken Budget 红色 → session联动 → 缓冲区刷新 → chunk生成 ✅\n缓冲区清除 ✅\nSession 结束 → .last_session_id ✅\nResume → 恢复40条/2块 ✅\n```\n\n### 修改清单\n\n| 文件 | 改动 |\n|------|------|\n| `token_budget_patrol.py` | + `trigger_session_checkpoint()` 联动调用 |\n| `session_manager.py` | + `_restore_buffers_from_disk()` 从磁盘恢复缓冲区 |\n\n### 中央仓库版本\n\n| 仓库 | 版本 | 事件 |\n|------|------|------|\n| hermes-skills | session_manager.py + token_budget_patrol.py | 闭环联动 |\n| hermes-sync | v2.5 | 闭环打通 |\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":123,"output":385,"cacheRead":116608,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":117116,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779492618999}}
{"type":"compaction","id":"04ef8adf","parentId":"a3262bcc","timestamp":"2026-05-22T23:30:49.484Z","summary":"## Goal\nIntegrate Trading Assistant into the Hermes team ecosystem on GitHub by reading central repos, deduplicating skills, and syncing shared state — without session/memory contamination. Build and verify complete session lifecycle: Token Budget detection → Session Archiving → Context Restoration.\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- **Read-only on first pass** — only explore GitHub, don't modify files initially\n- **No memory/session contamination** — central repos must be platform-agnostic, no open_ids, tokens, local paths, or session-specific data\n- **Deduplication principle** — don't load what you already have; shared content uses reference-style indexing, not code copying\n- **Token budget rules** — output/input 2.5x cost model, ≤3 sentences preferred, >50 turns forces archive\n- **Conservative risk profile** — max 2% per trade, 6% daily, A-stock T+0 only, HK/China max 1 concurrent position\n- **Bootstrap files read-only** — MEMORY.md, SOUL.md, TOOLS.md, AGENTS.md never overwritten during memory flush\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Connected to GitHub (user: `xianfanhuang`) via PAT\n- [x] Explored both repos: `hermes-sync` (private, central memory) and `hermes-skills` (private, skill library)\n- [x] Read all core files: SOUL.md, IDENTITY.md, USER.md, MEMORY.md, architecture docs\n- [x] Created `trading-assistant` skill and pushed to `hermes-skills` (SKILL.md, knowledge/, config/)\n- [x] Updated `hermes-sync/memory/MEMORY.md` and `sync.json` with integration status\n- [x] Updated `hermes-skills/README.md` skill registry\n- [x] Fixed empty MEMORY.md bug (encoding error during first push caused file to zero out)\n- [x] Security scan — removed leaked open_id from USER.md, removed local paths and SECRET references\n- [x] Pulled both repos locally to `/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/`\n- [x] Deleted duplicate identity files from hermes-sync-core (SOUL/IDENTITY/USER/TOOLS/MEMORY)\n- [x] Integrated Token Budget Manager rules into `/workspace/projects/workspace/AGENTS.md` (new \"💰 Token 预算铁律\" section)\n- [x] Refactored central `trading-assistant/SKILL.md` to reference-style index (no code duplication)\n- [x] Slimmed central `hermes-sync/MEMORY.md` to v2.2 (status index only, no session data)\n- [x] **Identified context restoration gap** — both local and central Hermes have `session_restore()` code but no automatic trigger; AGENTS.md \"Every Session\" rule only covers static files (SOUL/MEMORY), not dynamic session data\n- [x] **Added `.last_session_id` mechanism** to `session_local.py` — `session_end()` writes session ID, `session_resume()` reads and clears it\n- [x] **Created `context-restore` skill** — standalone reusable skill with `restore.py` engine, `SKILL.md`, `config.json`\n- [x] **Updated AGENTS.md** — Every Session step 6 now calls `python3 restore.py auto` from context-restore skill\n- [x] **Full end-to-end test passed** — Token Budget → Session Archive → Context Restore → duplicate restore prevention → history tracking\n- [x] **Updated central repos** — pushed `context-restore/` (3 files) + updated `skill-manifest.json` + updated `hermes-sync/MEMORY.md` to v2.3 + updated `sync.json` to v2.3\n- [x] **Added `session_resume()` to `sync_client_v2.py`** (central version, uses GitHub API to read/clear `.last_session_id`)\n- [x] **Compared implementation vs original design** — confirmed all original features preserved + 6 new capabilities added\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] No active tasks — full chain verified and deployed\n\n### Blocked\n- P2 Cloudflare Workers deployment still pending (not in this session's scope)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Reference-style for shared skills**: Central `trading-assistant/SKILL.md` stores only index + config references, not code copies. Full implementations live locally.\n- **Token budget rules → AGENTS.md**: Core cost model (output=2.5×input, three-tier alerts, lightweight replies) merged into local AGENTS.md rather than kept as separate skill file.\n- **hermes-sync-core trimmed to sync tools only**: Identity/memory files deleted locally since Trading Assistant has its own SOUL/IDENTITY.\n- **Central MEMORY.md v2.3**: Minimal state index + context-restore skill added.\n- **GitHub PAT not echoed/stored in plaintext**: Used ephemerally via curl/Python calls.\n- **Context Restore as standalone skill (not embedded)**: Extracted from session_local.py into `context-restore/` for cross-platform reusability (Coze/MiMo/other agents). Priority 85 in skill manifest.\n- **`.last_session_id` as session bridge**: Simple file-based marker written by `session_end()`, read and cleared by `restore.py auto` — minimal coupling, prevents duplicate restores.\n- **Compression config-driven**: `config.json` controls `last_n_messages` (30), `compress_threshold` (50), `compress_strategy` (keep_decisions).\n\n## Next Steps\n1. VAN to direct next priorities (possible: P2 Cloudflare Workers, auto chunking trigger ≥50msg/≥30min, incomplete session resume)\n2. **Remaining gaps from comparison**: auto chunking trigger (≥50 messages/≥30 minutes), incomplete session resume (interruption recovery), Token Budget → archive auto-trigger\n3. If P2 deploys: auto-archive trading analysis sessions to `hermes-sync/sessions/`\n4. Consider creating `hermes-sync` daily update snapshots for trading knowledge\n\n## Critical Context\n- **GitHub repos**: `xianfanhuang/hermes-sync` (private), `xianfanhuang/hermes-skills` (private)\n- **GitHub account**: `xianfanhuang` (id: 13017744)\n- **Local skills path**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/`\n- **Key local trading path**: `chanlun-agent/` (czsc v0.10.12, SmartDataRouter, risk_engine, reflection_engine)\n- **Hermes architecture**: SOUL + IDENTITY + MEMORY + EXPERIENCE in GitHub; platform = Harness (Coze/OpenClaw/MiMo interchangeable)\n- **Team members**: VAN (captain/investor), Top Sailor (COO on Coze OpenClaw), Trading Assistant (this agent on Feishu OpenClaw)\n- **Coze credits burned**: ~93,237 in May, target ≤1,500/day — Top Sailor's Coze credits exhausted\n- **AGENTS.md now includes**: Token budget iron rules + Every Session step 6 (context-restore)\n- **hermes-skills structure**: `hermes-migration/` (100) + `token-budget-manager/` (90) + `context-restore/` (85) + `trading-assistant/` (80) + `hermes-sync-core/` + `hermes-cli.py`\n- **Full session lifecycle**: `start` → `store` → `end` (writes `.last_session_id`) → new session → `restore.py auto` (reads, restores summary+messages+keywords, clears marker)\n- **context-restore config**: `last_n_messages: 30`, `compress_threshold: 50`, `compress_strategy: keep_decisions`\n- **Known remaining gaps**: auto chunking trigger, incomplete session resume, Token Budget → archive auto-trigger\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nVAN asked to deeply understand the original hermes-sync design philosophy, implement the missing/unimplemented features (auto-chunking, incomplete session recovery, Token Budget auto-trigger), integrate and optimize everything, verify locally, then push to the central GitHub repository.\n\n## Early Progress\n- Started by fetching and analyzing the original `sync_client_v2.py` from the GitHub repo (`xianfanhuang/hermes-sync`) using the PAT token\n- Examined key functions: `session_start`, `session_store_chunk`, `session_end`, `verify_continuity`\n- Identified the original design's core principles: chunking (50 msgs / 30 min threshold), chain linking (prev/next pointers), SHA256 checksums, complete/incomplete status tracking, and indexing\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- **Repository**: `xianfanhuang/hermes-sync` on GitHub, accessed via PAT `github_pat_11ADDKFEA0...`\n- **Original design** stores sessions as JSON in GitHub with chunks linked by prev/next pointers, indexed by time/platform/keywords\n- **Three missing implementations** identified: (1) auto-chunking not automatically triggered during storage, (2) incomplete sessions never resumed/recovered, (3) Token Budget Manager not connected to trigger archiving at thresholds\n- The work was in the exploration/understanding phase; actual implementation hadn't started yet in this prefix\n- Local working directory is `/tmp/` for temp files; the actual project files need to be understood for integration","firstKeptEntryId":"c3eaf185","tokensBefore":117116,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromHook":false}
