ession_checkpoint():\n   subprocess.run([python3, session_manager.py, checkpoint, 55])\n\n   执行 token_budget_patrol.py:\n🔴 对话55轮，超红色阈值50，必须归档\n[session联动] 🔴 红色熔断: 轮次 55 ≥ 50\n   已刷新 1 个会话，请执行 /new\n\n============================================================\n  阶段3: checkpoint 执行详情\n============================================================\n\nsession_manager.py checkpoint(55) 内部执行流程:\n\n1. _restore_buffers_from_disk()\n   → 扫描 sessions/.buffer_session_*.json\n   → 找到 .buffer_{sid}.json\n   → 检查 active/{sid}.json 存在（会话仍活跃）\n   → 恢复 MessageBuffer 对象:\n     - session_id = sid\n     - messages = [40条]\n     - chunk_num = 0（还没有chunk）\n   \n2. 检查 rounds=55 ≥ TOKEN_STOP_ROUNDS=50\n   → 红色熔断！\n\n3. 遍历 self._buffers:\n   → buffer.flush(\"token_budget_red\")\n   \n4. flush 内部:\n   a. chunk_num += 1 → 1\n   b. chunk_id = {sid}_001\n   c. 构建 chunk_data:\n      - messages: [40条]\n      - message_range: [1, 40]\n      - checksum: sha256:...\n      - prev_chunk: None（第一个chunk）\n      - next_chunk: None（后面没有）\n      - flush_reason: \"token_budget_red\"\n   \n5. 写入 chunk 文件:\n   raw/2026/05/23/{sid}_001.json\n\n6. 更新 active/{sid}.json:\n   - chunks: [\"{sid}_001\"]\n   - message_count: 40\n   - last_chunk_time: now\n\n7. 清空缓冲区:\n   - messages.clear()\n   - 删除 .buffer_{sid}.json\n\n\n📁 active/: ['session_20260523_075307_996d18.json']\n\n📁 completed/: []\n\n📦 已生成chunks: ['session_20260523_075307_996d18_001.json']\n   session_20260523_075307_996d18_001.json:\n     messages: 40条\n     checksum: sha256:cae39ade473f9310\n     flush_reason: token_budget_red\n     prev_chunk: None\n     next_chunk: None\n\n   缓冲区文件仍存在: False\n\n============================================================\n  阶段4: 用户执行 /new（归档+清理）\n============================================================\n\n👤 用户: /new\n\n此时触发 AGENTS.md 定义的流程:\n\n1. session_end(sid, \"分析BTC走势，RSI超买需回调\", [\"BTC\",\"RSI\",\"技术分析\"])\n   → 刷新缓冲区（此时为空，已flush过）\n   → active/ → completed/\n   → 写入摘要文件\n   → 更新主索引\n   → 写入 .last_session_id\