{"type":"message","id":"209b0721","parentId":"eaca0bc3","timestamp":"2026-05-22T23:53:48.523Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also fix the message_count issue - when checkpoint flushes, the session index gets updated with the flushed count. But the session_index still had message_count=0 from the initial push (because pushes only update the buffer, not the session index directly). Let me check...\n\nActually, looking at the test output, the session_index shows message_count=0 after the first flush (checkpoint), then message_count=80 after end(). That's because the buffer was created with 40 messages, checkpoint flushed them and updated the session to 40. But the initial active session had message_count=0 because the buffer doesn't update the session index on each push.\n\n\nSo when checkpoint runs, it flushes 40 messages and sets the session's message_count to 40, then end() flushes another 40 (a duplicate) and adds them to get 80 total. After removing the duplicate buffer in checkpoint, the count should be correct. I need to verify that checkpoint's _restore_buffers_from_disk correctly restores the buffer's messages from the .buffer_*.json file - it does load the 40 messages and chunk_num=0, then checkpoint flushes them.\n\nNow I'm tracing through what happens when end() is called: it tries to get the buffer from self._buffers, but checkpoint already deleted it, so buffer is None and it skips the flush. The session data already has the correct message_count=40 and chunks=[\"001\"], so I need to run the test to confirm this is working properly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_935109e8919b4507abb44bae","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills\n\nrm -rf hermes-sync-core/sessions\nmkdir -p hermes-sync-core/sessions/index/active hermes-sync-core/sessions/index/completed\ncat > token-budget-manager/budget_state.json << 'EOF'\n{\"last_update\":\"\",\"daily\":{\"main_chat_rounds\":0},\"alerts\":[],\"history\":[]}\nEOF\n\npython3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport sys, os, json\nsys.path.insert(0, 'hermes-sync-core')\nfrom session_manager import SessionManager\n\nmgr = SessionManager()\n\n# 1. 创建+推入\nsid = mgr.start(\"feishu\", \"修复验证\")\nfor i in range(1, 41):\n    mgr.push(sid, {\"id\": i, \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": f\"消息{i}\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-23T08:00:00\"})\n\n# 2. checkpoint（模拟红色熔断）\nstate = json.load(open(\"token-budget-manager/budget_state.json\"))\nstate[\"daily\"][\"main_chat_rounds\"] = 55\njson.dump(state, open(\"token-budget-manager/budget_state.json\", \"w\"), indent=2)\nos.system(\"python3 token-budget-manager/token_budget_patrol.py\")\n\n# 3. end\nmgr.end(sid, \"修复验证\", [\"修复\"])\n\n# 4. 验证\ncompleted_path = f\"hermes-sync-core/sessions/index/completed/{sid}.json\"\nwith open(completed_path) as f:\n    s = json.load(f)\nprint(f\"\\n验证:\")\nprint(f\"  message_count: {s['message_count']} (期望: 40)\")\nprint(f\"  chunks: {s['chunks']}\")\nprint(f\"  chunks数量: {len(s['chunks'])} (期望: 1)\")\n\n# 5. resume\nprint()\nresult = mgr.resume(5)\nprint(f\"  恢复消息数: {result['message_count']} (期望: 40)\")\nPYEOF","timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":867,"output":1100,"cacheRead":79360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81327,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779494015903}}
