{"type":"message","id":"40f87db2","parentId":"e1a1327c","timestamp":"2026-05-22T23:55:20.426Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me also update the daily memory with the bug fix.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ce9823b67f4b460f898af677","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-23.md << 'EOF'\n\n## 闭环 Bug 修复 (07:55)\n\n### 问题发现\n- 演绎时发现 checkpoint → end() 会重复 flush\n- 原因: checkpoint 在子进程执行，flush 清空的是子进程的 buffer\n- 主进程 buffer 仍有 40 条消息，end() 再次 flush → 重复 chunk + message_count=80\n\n### 修复方案\n- `end()` flush 前检查 `.buffer_{sid}.json` 是否存在\n- 不存在 = 已被 checkpoint 子进程 flush → 清空内存消息，不重复 flush\n- 存在 = 未被 flush → 正常 flush\n\n### 测试结果: 20/20 通过\n- 包含子进程 checkpoint → end → resume 完整闭环验证\n- message_count=40, chunks=1 ✅\nEOF\necho \"✅ 记忆已追加\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":459,"output":272,"cacheRead":91840,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":92571,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779494114323}}
