{"type":"message","id":"cf8d9252","parentId":"74804b2e","timestamp":"2026-05-22T23:55:28.813Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me give VAN a summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## 演绎完成 + Bug 修复\n\n### 发现的 Bug\n\n```\ncheckpoint (子进程)          end (主进程)\n    │                           │\n    ▼                           ▼\nflush 写 chunk               buffer 仍有 40 条\n清空子进程 buffer             再次 flush → 重复 chunk!\n删除 .buffer_*.json\n```\n\n**根因**: 子进程 flush 清空的是子进程内存，主进程 buffer 不受影响。\n\n### 修复\n\n`end()` flush 前检查 `.buffer_{sid}.json` 是否存在：\n- 不存在 → 已被 checkpoint flush → 跳过\n- 存在 → 正常 flush\n\n### 回归测试: 20/20 ✅\n\n```\n📦 自动分块(60→50+10)     ✅\n📦 手动刷新(10条)          ✅\n🔍 连续性校验              ✅\n🔄 结束+恢复(60条/2块)     ✅\n🔄 重复恢复(📭无记录)      ✅\n💰 Token Budget(ok/warn)   ✅\n🔗 闭环(直接checkpoint)    ✅ 30条/1块\n🔧 异常恢复(崩溃模拟)      ✅\n🔗 闭环(子进程checkpoint)  ✅ 40条/1块 ← 关键验证\n🧠 恢复读取记忆            ✅\n```\n\n已推送到中央 hermes-skills。\n\n🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":290,"output":350,"cacheRead":92288,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":92928,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779494120439}}
